<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUKA Aninka: Reng Didik koˈ Luka</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Reng Didik koˈ Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Reng Didik koˈ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Tsar</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Awami na tse mgbangwu kama asi Luka</char> Basi awuni Bayahude baˈ, nema awa si ni nik awu. Awa basi gin ming ku amun kop Yesu baˈ mi mbir abi tse amgbangwu abami bana ban anereng atu yi Yesu, ko mi bana yik ki yami marakpa ne nung ming ku amun kop Yesu (1.2). Ba tsoˈ na tse amgbangwu ayama ming ashe ayi 59-63 koba di 70-80 gong ku nyir Yesu. Yasi mi na tse ka Roma. Na tse si Tiyofilus mgbangwu kama nema kasi ku koni nga.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Reng ku re kama kari koˈ Luka</char> na vung tsar atu yi Yesu, kadi awa sini ta Israˈila shur nibi gong mmimi boboˈ. Mgbangwu kama ni vung rengti nyer ti ban atu ayi nyir Yesu, kani ya ban reng ku nyer atu yi gur Yesu ti koma gbarshu. Ming ku reng nga, Luka na tsar mi Yesu na sang dum awowon atu ayi andishir abami na kpuradum.</para>
  <para style="ip">Anereng asima ayami amgbangwu ayama na ban, adidik nga ngaˈ 1-2 ni ngaˈ 9-19. Gyom mbinban yi anereng awama asi, nyir ku Yohana ni Baftisma, nibi nyi ni tum Arik ni Maryamu, nibi gbar yami abi tum Arik bana ti, ni yer yami abi kam bana koma nkpang kami na nyir Yesu, nibi ben yi Saminu ni Hanatu ming Kop Arik. Mbir anereng anung nga asi mi na nap Yesu anik Kop Arik, nibi gik zu uwa nikur, nibi yer yi Yesu mi na koma ni Maryamu nibi Marta, nibi mi Yesu na yer kop Zakka. Hara zaˈa gyom anung yi awuni Samariya awami na tsar ro susun ma, nibi gyom awuni ki koˈ abami Liˈazaru, nibi reng ku awuni Farisi nibi ni ta ankor mmimi, nibi mi Yesu na far ru amun kop ma awaa tsir mi ba tsin na koma Imawus.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ming mgbangwu kama na reng atu yi ben awowon, nibi Rim yisi Tsetser, nibi ndum kami amba na nam Yesu ming ku anedum ama, nibi mbiban ro susun yami Arik na tsar andishir abi gong mmimi ta tsoˈ zup mbobom man agura.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nitse mgbangwu ma na vung ban anereng atu yi Nduma abi tum Arik mi abi zip Yesu ba dibi si ming ku vung iyii anereng ni re.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kiki yami si ming nga.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ni Tsar 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyir ni nkpyaˈ ku Yohana ni Baftisma nibi ku Yesu 1:5—2:52.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ndum ku Yohana ni Baftisma 3:1-20</para>
  <para style="io1">Baftisma yi Yesu 3:21-22 Atuting ayi Yesu 3:23-38</para>
  <para style="io1">Mi na tsar Yesu ankwang 4:1-13 Ndum ku Yesu Galili 4:14—9:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu na dung Galili ta koma 9:51—19:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Anedum awu Yesu ni tera, ni mi na rop wu ni kuu 19:28—23:56</para>
  <para style="io1">Gur Yesu ri nebi kpyi, nibi kam nga ma, nibi gur ma ti koma gbarshu 24:1-53.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Kiyami ni dung Luka na tse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Nidum bana tsoˈ ti tse anareng awami ba na wo ta yik ne ayi man kiyami ni nam ming mbor, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />ba na tse kiyami na ban kwara anu abi tum Arik ni abi ndum na yik na yiman kiki yami tsin ri nkpang ti nga, siba ban reng Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nema, ngga itu mung ni dzip koneni ananan ri ting nga, ngga ni yik yani wyer ngga bi tse ya ananan, wa nder nkpyaˈ Tiyofalas, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />ti wa bi gi yasi ananan ni wyer ku reng didik kami bana ban wa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na ban nyir ku Yahaya ni Baftisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Nkpang ku etum Hiridus awami agir Yahudiya, nati ni tok ankpur nung agyo wu ti Zakariya, asi gar ni tok ankpur Abija, na ta wa min kop Haruna, saˈ ma si Alisabatu, <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Gbaˈ wa mana basi andishira adidik iti Arik, ba dzip kiyami Atikop amoˈ boboˈ nibi tsin ma nibi tsir didik, <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />nema ba basi ne vɨvɨn baˈ, ti Alisabatu ba nyir baˈ, gbaˈ wa man bana tser.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Arika anung ama, Zakariya na dibi nam ndum ma ku tok ankpur kop Arik, ndum ma kani kamgong ti koma ni andishira man. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Nnam mana abi tok ankpur, asi atun wu ba ku tsoˈ, Zakariya awa mi ati rir ta gbu nkawu, kop Arik ku Atikop. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Nkpang ku gbu nkawu ni shishim, andishir na bing, ta atir abum boboˈ ta dibi ben.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ni tum awu Arik awu Atikop siwa afar aru, ta tir nawu gar koˈri ba ku gbu nkawu ma. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Mi Zakariya na yik wu si wyir kpa, si shishi ti wu. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Asi ni tum awu Arik adi wu, “Kɨr ti shishi baˈ Zakariya, bana ta ben mi, wa nibi awami Alisabatu ati nyir wa vɨvɨn, bati gyo wu ti Yohana, <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Wati nyer ti muar awowon, andishir nidum bati rak wa nyer nyir ma, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ati si nder nkpyaˈ iti Atikop, bati so amashir inabi ni kiki nung mi ayi baˈ. Ati shuma ni rim Tsetser, tsoˈ ri mi asi nne ku iyama. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ati gir ani Israˈila nidum ta kama koma ni Atikop Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ati riti ming ku rim yi tsi mi Iliya, ati kam asusun adida asaˈ ne amumun aman, ti ba kam abi kak wo reng ti dzip tsir didik, tiba nam andishir ane Atikop.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya nadi ni tum awu Arik, “Ngga nam are tin gi? Ngga wa nika tser, uwa mung nati nvi waa masi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ni tum awu Arik nadi asi ngga Jibrilu, “Ngga tir iti ku Arik. Na tum ngga bi ban wa reng ku re, ati nam wa ki didik. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ta sima, wati ti anfik atong, bawa ti gi reng baˈ, se arika wami kima ni Shuma, wa ti nag ta reng mung nyima baˈ, wati sin yik nvima.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Andishir ba song angup Zakariya, mi ba na yik ku na gong, ta shum ani yani kyaˈ wu ne ming kop Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Mi na ru bagi reng baˈ, si badi nati rimrar ming kop Arik. Si adibi reng ba ni koˈ, bagi reng ne nu baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Nkpang kami ndum ma kani ter, na kama koma kop. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Gong ku nvi, si uwama Alisabatu agir nne. Si sung ka arer yi kwa tung, ta di, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Atikop na tun ngga shisha ming andishir ta gi ayi to ngga ma, ta tsoˈ shisha agur ngga ma na andishir.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na ban nyir Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ming kwa ku tani, asi Arik atum ni tum Jibrilu ntun nung, yi saˈ Nazaret, gar Galili, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ta tum mu nebi vɨn wa nung, mi bana gi nurum baˈ, saˈ ma si Maryamu, mi ndishir nung na bun wu agyo wu ti Yusufu, ming kop Dawuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Asi ni tum Arik na koma na wu, ta di, “Aba tik wa, mi na tun wa, Atikop asi ndo niwa, wati yik ki didik” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maryamu na wo tik yama, asi awa kpuradum, ta dibi shum tadi asi tik tama yasima. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Asi ni tum awu Arik adi wu, kɨr ti shishi baˈ, Maryamu. Wati yik ki didik iti Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ati wa, ti gir nne, ti nyir vɨvɨn wati gyoˈ saˈ ma ti Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ati si kpyaˈ bati gyo wu ti Zu Arik awami na Shuyi. Atikop Arik ati nik ku iron yi etum ada ma Dawuda.<verse eid="LUK 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ati gir kop Yakub song ni song, gir ma baya sini tong ter baˈ <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maryamu nadi ni tum Arik, “Kiyama ti nam are ama, ba ngga ni ngi nirum baˈ?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Asi ni tum Arik na ta nyima ta di, “Rim Tsetser ti ji itumi, Tsi Ma ti kung wa. Nema vɨvɨn awami wati nyir wu ma atisi tsetser, Zu Arik ni shuyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />To iva min awa Alisabatu, adi ba nyir baˈ, towa asi ni nne kwa tani ni tser ma.” <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />“Arik, ba ankpyeng yami ati ban, ti bana nam ma baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maryamu adi, “To ngga wa, gan awu Atikop, nkpyeng mi bi song ngga ama mi wani ban.” Asi ni tum Arik agur ta dung wu.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maryamu na koma ni Alisabatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Invi yama Maryamu na koma andanda ntun yi gbu gar Yahudiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Na rir kop Zakariya, ta tik Alisabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Mi Alisabatu na wo tik Maryamu, si vɨvɨn Alisabatu atu nne ma. Alisabatu na shuma ni Rim Tsetser. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Na gi kor ma kpankpang ta di, “Wa si ne anu didik ming amba, vɨvɨn ni si nne mi asi ne anu didik. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Asi ani, ki didik ama ti nyi tu mung, tiba di iyama Atikop amun ati nyi ni ngga? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Mi ngga ni wo tik mi na tong amung, asi vɨvɨn ni kur ming nne mung natu awowon ta nyer. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Anu didik ka song awami na ta nyima, ni tum yi Atikop yami na tum wa ma naya tesi zup?”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aron Maryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Asi Maryamu adi, “Susun mmi ka ni tsoˈ wa Atikop,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />ti rim mung ya nyer Arik ni ta shur, <verse eid="LUK 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Na to kornyin mung ngga gan ama. Andishir boboˈ nkpang ku nyi, ba di wa yik anu didik iti mi. <verse eid="LUK 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Awa sini tsi nang, na nam ngga kiki kpinkpyaˈ, saˈ ma si tsetser. <verse eid="LUK 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Tsoˈ ri nkaˈ ni nkaˈ, na ro susun abami bati shishi ma. <verse eid="LUK 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Na nam kiki kpinkpyaˈ ni koˈ ma, abi tsik asang ashum susun aman na sher ba var. <verse eid="LUK 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Na ji atu atum, iron yi etum man, ta aya gi abami baba si kinung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Na nik abi gyong shir, ta dung abi sini ki koˈ ayok akukur. <verse eid="LUK 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Na rak gan ama Israˈila, na shum ta ro susun man. <verse eid="LUK 1:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Na nam kiyami na ban anchichim mbor, Ibrahim nibi andishir ama song ni song” <verse eid="LUK 1:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maryamu na song ni vaman Alisabatu yi kwa tar, ta sin na kama koma kop.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyir ku Yahaya ni Baftisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ti nkpang ku nyir, Alisabatu kani ti, asi awa nyir vin nurum. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Abi song nga wu ne mun zuman nawo kiyami Atikop na ro susun mung, siba rak ngga nyer ra. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Vɨvɨn nati nvi tandar siba nyi tiba sher wu, siba nik vina saˈ ada ma Zakariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Nema iyama vin na nadi, “O'o. Aba gyo wu ti Yohana.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Siba diwu, “Nga ming amun zumin asi ni saˈ kama.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Si ba rip ada ma vin na ne yok tiba ban saˈ kami ba gyo wu ma. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Si adi ba gir awa kitse ma, si tse, “Saˈ ma kasi Yohana.” Andishir akama to kpa ta vung nunu. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Abuma asi anu ma ka bu, siwa vung reng ta gbar saˈ Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Si shishi ya vung abi song nga wu abuma. Andishir ba reng atu ayi kiyami ni nam koneni gar gbu Yahudiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Boboˈ abami nawo reng kama, ta dibi shum ka susun aman tadi, “Vin na ma ati kasi ani?” Ti na gi koˈ Atikop kasi ndo nawu. <verse eid="LUK 1:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Ada ma Zakariya Rim Tsetser ni kung wu mi na nik anu, tadi, <verse eid="LUK 1:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />Anu didik ka nyi ri ne Atikop Arik ni Israˈila. Na nyi bi ta andishira ma shur. <verse eid="LUK 1:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Na gik ni ta kwara shur ne tsi atu mbor, ri kop gan ama Dawuda, <verse eid="LUK 1:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ya simi na amin aban nkpang nga ari nunu yi abi reng ne antinte Arik abi si tsetser ri kukup, <verse eid="LUK 1:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />ati ta kwara shur ayok dzen zor ambor, ni boboˈ abami kak kwara ki. <verse eid="LUK 1:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Nema na ro susun anchichim mbor, iba ku shum kiyami bana arop abing yisi tsetser, <verse eid="LUK 1:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />arim ayami na she ada mbor Ibrahim, <verse eid="LUK 1:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ati ta kwara shur ayok dzen zor ambor, ti aba nam ndum ma sang nga shishi, <verse eid="LUK 1:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kwara bi song tsetser ti nam ki didik iti Arik, boboˈ nvi yi song mbor. <verse eid="LUK 1:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />“Wa vin vina ma, ati di wasi ni reng ne antinte Arik ni Shuyi. Wati ri Atikop iti, ti nam wu tsir. <verse eid="LUK 1:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Ati ban andishira aba gi tsir ku ta ba shur tiba tsoˈ zup mbombom man agura. <verse eid="LUK 1:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Asi mi Arik ro susun mbor awowon, der ma yi ta kwara shur ya ne far ru ri shu, <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Ati der ra sher abi song ibuu, nebi song gyu yi kuu, ti aba gir kwara ta zip tsir ku shi keke.” <verse eid="LUK 1:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mi vɨna na fur, si rim ma ya si gbangbang. Tiya song ankwang se nvi yami na gir tuma aruma ni Israˈila.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Na nyir Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Nvi yami, Kaisar Augusta na nik anu tadi, andishir abami asong mmimi Roma aba tse ba boboˈ. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Yi yama si ban yi kuti nkpang ku Etum Kiriniyus, ni mmimi Suriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Koni nga na kam akoma ntun ma tiba tse saˈ ma ta ban wu.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusufu na gur ari tsip Nazaret ming Galili taya koma ming Batalomi gar Yahudiya, ntun yami na nyir Etum Dawuda. Na koma mung nga ti asi ming anting ayi ni Dawuda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Na koma bi tse ta tsin ndo neni Maryamu, awami na nik anu ati bun wu, nkpang kuku ma asi ni nne. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Mi ba si Batalomi, nkpang ku nyirma kani ti. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Na nyir vɨna ma nigur ra ta kung wu ni kpaˈ antur kuso vɨvɨn, ta jiwu agyoˈ gbor, ti baba na yik abum ni kur baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni tum awu Arik na ban nyir Yesu ne abi kam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Gar ntun na ankwang, abi kam ba ko kur abum nibu, ba dibi ber awantama man nidum. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ba kokur awa, si ni tum awu Atikop afara aru ba, asi nkpyaˈ ku Arik ka der sher ba, siba ti shishi awowon. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Nema ni tum awu Arik adi ba, “Kɨr ti gin shishi baˈ. Ti ngga ni gir gina reng ku re, kami ti dung andishir boboˈ anyer awowon. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Arɨng ama, ming ntun Dawuda, na nyir gina ni ta gina shur, awa si Kristi Atikop. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Awa asi gina kam mbir, gina ti yik na nyin nu ni kpaˈ antur ku so vɨvɨn, ta jiwu agyoˈ gbor abi kam.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ba song awa si abi tum Arik akpaˈ ba ari shu ta far aru abing ne ni tum Arik ni iti, siba gbar saˈ Arik tadi,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Gbar yi Arik amung ming shu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">gong mmimi kabi song keke ne abami Arik awo reman awowon.” <verse eid="LUK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Mi abi tum na dung ba ta kam akoma shu, si abi ber randong ba na reng ne akpaman, “Dung kwara koma Batalomi adza'a, ti bati to kiyami ne nam, mi Atikop na ban kwara.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Siba koma andanda tati yik Maryamu neni Yusufu, asi aba ya yik vɨvɨna ako kur gbor. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Mi abi ber bana yik vɨvɨna, asiba ban andishir kiyami ni tum Arik na reng atu ayi vɨvɨna. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Boboˈ abami na awo anareng awama, siba ti shishi atu kiyami abi ber randong na ban ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Maryamu na gir kikiyama boboˈ, ta adibi shum reng nga susun ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Abi kam awantam asiba akam koma ta adoˈ aron ta gbar saˈ Arik, atu kiyami bana wo, ni kiyami bana yik. Koneni ni nam mi ni tum Arik na ban ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na sher Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mi nvi yi tandar ni ti, asiba sher wu, asiba gyo wu ti Yesu, saˈ kami ni tum Arik na ban tsoˈ ri mi agir nne ma.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na nap Yesu nik kop Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Nkpang kani nyi tong ter asi Yusuf ni Maryamu bati nam kiyami Amoˈ Musa na di aba nar ba, asi gir Yesu ta koma Rushelima, ti aba nap wu anik Atikop. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Asi kiyami na tse amoˈ ayi Ada tadi, “Kowuni vɨn nirum ningur awami na nyir wu, ati nap wu anik Atikop ti ba si tsetser”, <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />siba aya anik Atikop, “Agurgu awaa ne amun ambam agurgu awaa mi amoˈ ayi Atikop nadi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Nkpang kama ndishir nung asi Rushelima, ni saˈ Saminu, anam ki didik, taya zip Arik, asong angup arika awami ati ta Israˈila shur. Rim Tsetser yasi nawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Rim Tsetser ni nyi wu, ti diwu bati kuu baˈ se na yik Kristi Atikop. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Rim ni gir Saminu tsin na, ti koma kop Arik. Nkpang kami ada nebi iyama bana gir vɨna ma Yesu, tiba nam kiyami amoˈ Musa nadi, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Asi Saminu na ta vɨna agir ayoˈ ama ta gbar saˈ Arik, tadi,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Adza'a, Atikop wabi reng ti aba dung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">gan ami ba koma keke.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ngga ni yik ta gyoˈ mi na ayi mung,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />yami wani nam iti andishir boboˈ,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />der mi yani tsar anung abami baba si Yahudawa baˈ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">tiba gir nkpyaˈ ma ne andishir abi Israˈila.<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ada ma nebi iya ma vɨna siba avung anu, ta ti shishi kiki yami Saminu na ban atu ayi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Saminu na nik ba anu didik tadi wa Maryamu, “Iyama vɨna Arik na tun vɨna ma ti abasi kiyi dung anung aroku, nebi gur ni bi kpyi yi anung nidum Israˈila. Ati si kam mbir kami andishir nidum bati kaˈ wu. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Nema ti dung kiyami ku kur asusun aman ati bur ra aruma. Ya ti rowa ma mi anjigbang kati tur susun mmi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Tsitser uwa nung asi ni reng ni antinte Arik ni saˈ Hanatu, va Fanuwel kop Asher. Na song ni ruma ashe tangba ni nga ma, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />mi ruma na kuu. Awa asi ne ashe sok tangdar ni nas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tangdar ni nas. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ti ashe sok tangdar ni nas ako song kur.</char></note> Ba dung kop Arik baˈ, adibi gbar saˈ arik, buu ne arik ta rop anu ta ben. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Na nyi ananan npkang nga asi awa vung nyer Arik, ta reng atu yi vɨna tadi boboˈ abami anwup ta gyoˈ yi Arik Rushelima.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusuf ni Maryamu na kam akoma kopman Nazarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusuf neni Maryamu bana nam koneni ter tsar Amoˈ ayi Atikop, asi aba kam akoma ntun man Nazaret ming Galili. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mi vɨna na fur, ta tsi, ta ya shuma ne ankpyeng. Ki didik ya Arik yasi ituma.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na reng ne abi tsar kop Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kowuni she ada nebi iya ma ba koma Rushelima bi nam Gang yi Zor. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Mi Yesu nati ashe wur ne waa ayi nyir siba koma gang yami ba tsin anam. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Nkpang kami gang ni ter, siba vung tsir ti aba kam akoma kop, asi Yesu, vɨvɨna na tir gong Rushelima bani gi adida ma baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bana tsin akurik, bana tsoˈ asi ming andishir neba. Aring siba vung wop wu ming amun zuman ne adzidzen ama. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Mi baba na yik ku baˈ. Siba akam akoma Rushelima bi wop wu ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Asi nvi yi tar siba yik wu kop Arik ako song ming abi tsar Yahudawa ta wo ba ta dibi rip ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Abami na wo wu, siba vung nunu gir ta gi ki yami aban ba, ata rip awa tanyima. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Adida ma bana yik wu siba mis atu, si iyama adi wu, Zu mung, asi ani dung wani nam kwara ma? Kwara dibi wop wa ne ada mi susun mbor ni chokra, ba kwara ni yik wa baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />“Asi ani dung gina wop ngga?” Awa rip. “Ba gina nigi ko takaˈ ngga bi song kop Ada mung sang yi?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Nema ba bana gi ni kiyami reng atu ma baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu na akam azip ba, Nazaret, ta wo reng ku adida ma. Nema iyama na dibi nne kiki yama boboˈ susun ta shum ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Mi Yesu na fur ta shuma na ankpyeng ni nkpyaˈ, mi Arik anyer wu tasi ki didik ne andishir.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Reng arik ku Yohana Ni Baftisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ming ku ashe wur ne tung etum Kaisar Tibariya neni, Buntus Bilatus asi awa gir gar Yahudiya. Hiridus asi etum Galili. Zuman Filibus agir Ituriya neni Tarakunitas. Lisaniyas agir Abija, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />nkpang kami Hanana ne Kayafa asiba si abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ. Nkpang kukuma si nkpyeng reng yi Arik ni nyi Yohana zu Zakariya ankwang. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Asi Yohana dzip bubum ta koma nya Juda, ta dibi ban reng Arik tadi andishir aba kam asan, na aba tiba baftisma ti ba tsoˈ zup mbombom man agura. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Yasi mi na tse ming mgbangwu ku Ishaya ni reng ne antinte Arik tadi, “Kor ka gyo ming ankwang kadi, Gina bi nam Atikop tsir, gina bi nap ane tsir ama. <verse eid="LUK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ati nap kowuni nfor, ati jir nkpang ashur neni gbu kpyaˈ. Ati nap tsir kami kani dan, na aba nam mbombom tsir ti kabi kong. <verse eid="LUK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Boboˈ andishir bati nam ta gyoˈ ya Arik.” <verse eid="LUK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohana nadi bing ya andishira abami na nyi aba tiba baftisma, “Gina ni nyi mbombom ani hywa. Nga na vim gina bi tsur je kami ka nyi? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Gina bi kam san ti tsintsin didik kami ti tsar gina ni ta Arik. Kɨr gina bi shum asusun amin tidi, Ibrahim awa si ada mbor. Ti ngga ban gina Arik asi ni tsi yami ati nik Ibrahim amumun ri nkpang yi yama. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Na ka amin asaˈ anu agber aring nkunkun, ti nkunkun kami baka ni nyir mumun didik ba', ba chemka gyoˈ uwur.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Asi andishir ba arip wu, “Asi ani kwara nam?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Na tayima tadi, “Awami asi ni ntuntur waa, aba gap ne awami asang nga ma ni gin, awami asi ni ki ri aba nam ama.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Abi ta ankor mmimi bana nyi ti aba tiba baftisma, asi aba rip wu tadi, Nitsar, kwara ti nam are? <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Na diba, “Kɨr gina bi ta gari kam kiyami na di aba ta.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Abi rop akpa bana rip wu, “Kwara pa? Kwara nam are?” Asi awa diba, “Kɨr dung gin andishir anik gina ankor ni tsi. Kɨr ya ti gin neba nmu baˈ atu yami bana kak nik gina ankor. Kiyami awang gina bi mar gina.” <verse eid="LUK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Andishir bana ngwup nyi yi Kristi, boboˈ man asi ba shum susun aman ko Yohana asi Kristi ni. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Asi Yohana adi ba, “Ngga ti gina baftisma na mashir, ti nung awami ati nyi na nang ngga ni nkpyaˈ, ba ngga ni mar awami ngga ti juk aririk akpadza ama baˈ. Asi awa ati ti gina baftisma ne Rim Tsetser ne wur. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Awa gir mbubum ma, ati dzeng npyeng, ta abing alkama ama ashur ming gbu ma. Nema ati ngbu anfur ayami bana gi dzeng nga baˈ, ni wur kami baka rim baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Nema asi awa rip ba atu yi kiki nung nidum, Yohana na ban andishir reng arik ku re. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Nema Yohana na vim gomna Hiridus, atu yami awa Hiridus na ta Hiridiya, uwa zuman Filibus, nebi nam kiki mbombom nidum. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hiridus na nanam adi, aba vung Yohana kung jaru.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nati Yesu Baftisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Gong kami na ka ati andishir boboˈ baftisma, asi aya ti Yesu ma sima. Asi ming ku ben, asi shu ka bu, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Rim Tsetser mi agurgu ni ji song ituma. Asi awo kor nung ka ri shu tidi, “Wasi zu Arik, awami ngga ni ta wu nyima. Ngga wo remi awowon.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atuting ayi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Nkpang kami Yesu na vung ndum ma ku tsar, asi ne ashe soktar gong mmimi. Andishir bana tsoˈ wu asi zu Yusufu. Yusufu zu Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli zu Mattat, Mattat zu Lawi, Lawi Zu Malki, Malki zu Yanna, Yanna zu Yusuf, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusuf zu Mattatiya, Mattatiya zu Amos, Amos Zu Nahum, Nahum zu Hasli, Hasli zu Najaya, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Najaya zu Ma'ata, Ma'ata zu Mattiya, Mattiya zu Shimeya, Shimeya zu Yosek, Yosek zu Yoda. <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda zu Yowanan, Yowanan zu Resa, Resa zu Zerubbabel, Zerubbabel zu Sheyaltiyel, Sheyaltiyel zu Niri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Niri zu Malki, Malki zu Adi, Adi zu Kosama, Kosama zu Elmadama, Elmadama zu Er, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er zu Yoshuwa, Yoshuwa zu Eliyezer, Eliyezer zu Yorim, Yorim zu Mattat, Mattat zu Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi zu Simeon, Simeon zu Yahuda, Yahuda zu Yusuf, Yusuf zu Yonam, Yonam zu Eliyakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim zu Meleya, Meleya zu Menna, Menna zu Mattata, Mattata zu Natan, Natan zu Dawuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawuda zu Yesse, Yesse zu Obed, Obed zu Bowaz, Bowaz zu Salmon, Salmon zu Nashon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashon zu Amminadab, Amminadab zu Aram, Aram zu Hezron, Hezron zu Ferez, Ferez zu Yahuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yahuda zu Yakub, Yakub zu Ishaku, Ishaku zu Ibrahim, Ibrahim zu Tera, Tera zu Nahor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor zu Serug, Serug zu Reyu, Reyu zu Feleg, Feleg zu Eber, Eber zu Shela. <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela zu Kenan, Kenan zu Arfakshad, Arfakshad zu Shem, Shem zu Nuhu, Nuhu zu Lamek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek zu Metusela, Metusela zu Enok, Enok zu Yared, Yared zu Mahalalel, Mahalalel zu Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan zu Enosh, Enosh zu Set, Set zu Adamu, Adamu awa si zu Arik.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Nirem na ti Yesu ba roku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu na shum ma ni Rim Arik, mi na kam ma nga ari nya Juda. Rim Arik ne tsoˈ wu ti rir ming ankwang, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />mi nirem na tsar wu yi nvi soknas, nvima bana ri kinung ba'. Asi tong tera gyong ne vung wu.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Asi Nirem adi wu, Wa tesi Zu Arik, wa bi tsing nkpang yama bi ti deng.<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu na tayima tadi, na tse ming reng Arik tadi, “Bani deng ankyaˈ ndishir ati song baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ayang nga, asi Nirem na gir wu ta koma baku wur gbangbang, ta tsar wu boboˈ' tsi yi gong mmimi ming vɨn mkpang tsap. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Nirem adi wu, “Ngga ti nik wa tsi boboˈ atu yi ani tsi yama ne nkpyaˈ ma, ti na nik ngga tsi atu man. Ngga ti ya nik awami ngga ni tawu nyima. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Boboˈ' kikiyama ya tisi mi, in wati gbar ngga.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu na tayima tadi, “Na tse tadi, wa bi gbar Atikop Arik ami ti ben wu kikima.”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Asi Nirem agir wu ta koma Rushelima, ta asaˈ wu amung shushu Kop Arik, ta adi wu, “Wati si Zu Arik,” To, wabi tok roku mmimi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Asi ama na tse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">Ati nik ni tum ama anu atu ammi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">aba kyaˈ wa, <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Bati kyaˈ wa na ayok aman dung kɨr wa bi ngur kpa mi nkpang sang.<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu na tayima, “Ta di Kɨr wa bi tsar Atikop Arik ami sang.”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Gong kami Nirem na tsar Yesu ater ane tsir awama, asi awa dung wu yi vɨn nkpang aring.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na vung ndum ma mmimi Galili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Asi Yesu akam akoma mmimi Galili, tsi yi Rim Arik ya si ndo ne wu, Anereng ama na rir koneni ming mmimi ma. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Na tsar ming kop ku bing man, koni nga gbar wu.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na ka' Yesu ntun ma Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu na koma Nazaret, iba kami na fur ra. Na rir kop ku bing, arik ne song shi mi atsing na nam. Na gur atir ti aba ban mgbangwu. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Asi ba anap wu mgbangwu Ishaya ni reng ne antinte Arik, si anyin ka ta rir ba kami tsema di,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Rim Atikop yasi ndo ni ngga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Arik na kin ngga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ti ngga bi ban reng ku re abi sang nga ki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Na tum ngga bi ban reng ku gyoˈ abami atir rop ati juk ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ngga bi ban abefik ati yik ntun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ati gyoˈ abami na kwang ba,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />ngga bi ban andishir nkpang kani nyi kami Atikop ati ta andishir ama ashur.” <verse eid="LUK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Asiwa kung mgbangwu ma ta nik ni nam ndum, ta jisong. Boboˈ andishir kop ku bing arika siba shuru ayi, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />asi awa diba, “Reng kama kani shuma atong amin ari nga.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Boboˈ ba na wore ma ta dibi anyer wu, ba dibi shum anareng ama ki didik yami na ban ba, siba di, “kaut, awama basi zu Yusufu sang yi?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu na diba, “Ngga ni ngi gina ti ban gin ankpyeng ayama, wani nik awu, wabi nam tumi. Gina ti ya di ngga, wabi nam kiki yami kwara ni wo wani nam Kafarnahum, wabi nam ma ayang ntun mi.” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />“Ngga ban gina zup,” ngga vung ban gina, “Ba ni reng ne antinte Arik awami atawu ayima ntun ma. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ngga ban gina zup, nkpang ku Iliya ni reng ni antinte Arik, amba nung abami aruruman na kpyi nidum Israˈila, nkpang kami awur ni shu na kak ku ma yi ashe tar ni kwa tani, na aya ti mbombom gyong koneni gar mmimi ma. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Nema ba na tum Iliya ni reng ni antinte Arik ne nung ming man baˈ, tisi amung nga na tum mu ni wa nung awa mi ruma naka kuu ntun Zarifat ming Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Nkpang ku Elisha ni reng ne antinte Arik, nati abi ankpuˈ anung nidum ntun Israˈila. Arik ba na nam nung min mana ba', anaˈ asi Naˈaman ndishir ni Suriya ankyaˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Boboˈ andishir abami asi ming kop ku bing na awo kiyama, asi ba ti nfu awowon. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Asi ba gur ta gir Yesu ta koma gong ntun, tong gbu yami na mme ntun man tuma. Bana ati ba tur Yesu gyo' adudur mgbo', <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />asiwa dzip atsutsu man ta ti tsɨn ma.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam ndishir ni rim mbombom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Asi Yesu koma ntun Kafarnahum, mi yasi Galili. Mi na rir ta vung tsar andishir arik ni song shi. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Andishir abi siba ma amis atu tsar ma, ti anareng ama a tsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Ming kop ku bing, na ti ndishir nung nisi ne rim mbombom. Asi awa agi kor kpankpang tadi, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Anya immi ani ne kwara, Yesu ni Nazaret? Ko wa ne nyi wabi dar kwara ni? Ngga ni gi wasi nga, wa si Tsetser gin awu Arik.” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu na tsing wu tadi, “Kung anu. Ru na wu.” Asi rim mbombom ma nguru ata' agyoˈ mmimi itiman, ankyaˈ ya ru ti dung ndishira keke. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Boboˈ andishira avung nunu tadi akpa man, “Asi tsar ani sima? Ne gbegbereng ne tsi yami ndishira ma tsing anerim ti dung ba aru.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Kiyama mi Yesu na nam, ya ni dung areng atuma akam agong koneni mmimima.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam andishir nidum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu na aru ari kop ku bing, ta koma kop Bitrus. Iyama uwa Bitrus ba wore ba', vɨn iro ne vung wu. Siba ben Yesu aba nam wu. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Asi awa koma ti tir nawu baku kur ma, ta tsing vɨn iroma, siwa nam wu. Abubum siwa agur ta nam ba kiri. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Mi arik ati roku, boboˈ abami basi ni abi iro mbinban, asi gir ba ta nyi ni Yesu. Yesu naya saˈ konitama koˈ, ta nam ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Anerim ambombom bana aru ari akpa andishir nidum. Siba ti akwa tadi, “Wasi Zu Arik.” Nema Yesu na tsing ba, ta war ba reng atuma, ati bana agi awa si Kristi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ban reng Arik baku bing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Mi ambwer na ngan asi Yesu na dung ntuna ta koma ba kami nung ba sima baˈ. Andishir bana vung wop wu, siba ayik wu. Siba ati aba kyaˈ wu kɨr ba dung ba baˈ, <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Yesu na adi ba, “Yasi ananan, ngga bi koma ti ban reng ku re atu yi gir Arik ntutun nung mansi.” Tisi atu ayiyama na tum ngga. <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Asi awa gur ta koma ta vung ban reng arik kop ku bing ming mmimi Yahudiya boboˈ.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na gyo Amung kopma abi riti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Arika nung ama Yesu na tir tong Nyaˈ Janisarat, andishir ba na tip anyi ta kam wu agong ti aba wo reng Arik. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Asi awa ayik agum awaa ako tir tong nyaˈ. Yasi yi abi vuu ambe ba na aru ta dibi nar kiyi vuu ambe man. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Asi aji tong nya ming agum gin, kami kasi ku Bitrus, ta rip wu aba tur gum ma ari mmimi ta koma ming amashir tsap. Asi Yesu song ming gum ma ta dibi tsar andishir nidum. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Mi na reng ater, si adi wa Bitrus, “Wabi nanam tur gum ma ti koma iba kami rimp, ti gina bi gyoˈ kiyi vuu ambe min, gina vuu ambe.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Bitrus adi wu, “Wa Atikop, rini buu kwara dibi nam rak kana ma, ba kwara ni vung kinung baˈ, tasi mi wa ti reng ama, ngga ti gyoˈ kiyi vuu ambe tinto.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Mi ba na gyoˈ kiyi vuu ambe ma, asi ba vuu ambe nidum ti dung antur aku vuu ambe ma kata ti gbur ngau. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bana yik ama, asi ba agyo adzidzen aman gum gin na, nyi ti rak gin kwara ma. Asiba nyi ta vuu ambe ashur ashu agum awaa, agum ma nati jirim atu yiri. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Mi Bitrus na yik kiyami ni nam, asi awa atar agbarung iti Yesu tadi, “Dung ngga, Atikop. Ti ngga sine zup mbombom.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Ti awa ni abami basi ndo, asi shishi ya ti ba awowon atu yi ambe ayami bana vuu nidum, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />nema Yakubu ne Yohana, amun Zabedi, adzidzen abi nam ndum ne Bitrus. Asi Yesu adi Bitrus, “Kɨr ti shishi baˈ, tsoˈ ri adza'a wati dibi gir andishir, ba ambe baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Asi aba agbur agum aman ta koma mmimi, asi ba dung koneni, siba azip Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam ne ankpuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Arika anung ama Yesu asi ntun nung, asi ndishir nung awami iro ankpuk ni kung wu. Mi na yik Yesu asi awa aji itima gyoˈ, ta ben wu tadi, “Atikop, tasi mi wati tanyima, wabi nam ngga ti ngga bi si tsetser.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Asi Yesu a nap koˈ ma ta saˈ ni ankpuka, tadi, ngga ni ta nyim ma wabi wyer, za gin asi roma ya dung wu. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu na tsing wu, “Kɨr ba ban nung baˈ, ti wabi nak koma ti tsar ni tok ankpur itu mi ankyaˈ ti aba ato wa, tiba nik kinung atu yi kiyami Musa na di ata nar wa, ti bi song wa ti andishir aba gi wani wyer.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Nema anereng atu yi Yesu adibi riti mi awo wu koneni, ti dung andishir nidum ba dibi nyi nawu ti aba wo wu, taya wop aba nam ba anero man boboˈ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Nema Yesu amin na koma iba kami ba nung asima baˈ, tiba ti ben.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nam ne kuu kpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Arik ka nung ama Yesu asi ming ku tsar reng Arik, asi ani Farisi anung nebi tsar abami ako song iba ma bana nyi ari kowuni mun ntun yami si Galili, neni Yahudiya, neni tsip Rushelima. Tsi ya Atikop yasi ndo ne wu yami aba nam abi iro. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Asi andishira anung na tsoˈ ne kuu kpa kikur, asiba wop tsir ku gir wu ti rir ming kopa ti aba jiwu agyoˈ iti Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Nema ba bana yik tsir ku gir wu ti rir baˈ, ti andishir nati idum, siba wong itu tar ta gbur akpukpap angau siba aji wu agyoˈ vung kikur ma, atsutsu andishir iti Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Mi Yesu na yik zup didik man asi adi, “Dzen, na tsoˈ zup mbombom mi agur wama.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Ani Farisi nebi tsar amoˈ ba avung reng ne akpaman, “Asi wa nga reng mmar ama ne Arik. Arik ankyaˈ sini tsi yi tsoˈ zup mbombom mi agur ra.”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu na gi kiyami ba shum ma, si awa arip ba, asi ani dung gina shum kiyama susun amin? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Asi tama ni nang aba di, “Na tsoˈ agur wa zup mbombom mi,” ne aba di, “Gur tir, ti tsin?” <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Nema gina bi gi Zu ndishir asi ne tsi yi tsoˈ zup mbombom agura gong mmimi. Asi awa adi ni kuu kpa, “Ngga di, gur tir, ti tsoˈ kikur mi ti koma kop.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Za gin asi ndishira agur ayi koni nga, ta tsoˈ kikur yami na adik akur ituma, ta koma kop ta gbar saˈ Arik. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Boboˈ andishir abi si abuma bana shuma ne shishi, asi ba gbar saˈ Arik, tadi kwara ni yik ki shishi aring nga yami bati ngura shi baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Gyo Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Gong kama, Yesu na aru, ta yik nung ni ta ankor mmimi, ni saˈ Lawi, ako song baku ta ankor mmimi. Yesu nadi wu, “Dzip ngga.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Asi Lawi adung koneni boboˈ, ta ngura dzip wu. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Asi Lawi na nam gang nkpyaˈ kop ma, ta aya ban Yesu. Abi ta ankor mmimi nidum ndo na andishir abami asong ari kiri bing ne ba. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Nema awuni Farisi nebi tsar amoˈ si aba vung rukabum, tadi amun kop Yesu, “Tesi ani gina iri, ti ya so bing ndo nebi ta ankor mmimi nebi zup mbombom?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu na tanyima tadi, “Abami kpaman si keke, ba ndo man ne ni nik auwu, se abi iro. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ba ngga ni nyi gyo abi zup didik baˈ, se abi zup mbombom, ti ba ta Arik tiba san tsin man.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na rip atu yi rop anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Asi aba di Yesu, “Amun kop Yohana ba rop anu atu, atu, ta ya ben arik, nebi amun kop ani Farisi, nema to ami aba atsina ri ta so.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Asi Yesu tanyima ta di ba, “Gina tsoˈ ti di gina gi di adzidzen abi uwa wuwas aba rop anu, mi basi ndo nebi ni uwama? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Nkpang ka nyi mi ati atsoˈ ni uwa wuwas sa ta dung ba. Asi, nvima ba sin na rop anu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Asi Yesu anik ba ankpyeng anung ta di, “Ba awami ati gbur antur awuwas angau ti aba ras kpok antura ne ka. Ta nam ama, ya tisi mi na nyin antur awuwas atara, ba ya ti wyer aba ras antur awuwas ni kpok antur baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Nema ba awami ati shur amashir inabi awuwas ming akpoˈ aporo kpa. Ta nam ama, si amashir inabi awuwas sa aba ngar kpok aporo amashir inabi ma tiba vara sher, ti aporo akpa ma aba chok ara. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Amashir inabi awuwas se aba shur ru ming aporo kpa wuwas. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ba awami ati tanyima aba so amashir inabi awuwas gong kami na so kpok ka. Ati di, kpok ka wyer nang.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Na rip atu yi arik ni song shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Arik ni song shi anung ama, Yesu ne amun koma ba tsin ming kunkwang alikama, asi amun koma amwe adto alikama adibi nngo' a ayo' aman ta tang. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mi ani Farisi anung na yik ama siba di, “Ani dung gina nam kiyami amoˈ Musa na war ra aba nam ma arik ni song shi?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu na tanyima tadi, ba gina ni dik tika reng Arik mi Dawuda kiyami na nam awa nebi adzidzen ama, mi gyong ni tiwu? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Mi Dawuda na rir kop Arik, asi awa tsoˈ deng kami na neka kontong atang, ta nik adzidzen abi tsin ama, kiyami amoˈ na war ra koni nga aba tang, se ni tok ankpur ankyaˈ'?'' <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu adi ba, “Ai, Zu ndishir awa si Atikop ni arik ni song shi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam ni kuu koˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Arik ni song shi anung ama na rir kop ku bing ta dibi tsar. Si ming kopa ndishir nung abuma koˈ iri ma ni kuu. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Asi ani Farisi nebi tsar ashur ayi, ti ba to ka Yesu ati nam abi iro arik ni song shi, ti aba ayik tsir kami badi na tara. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ti Yesu na gi kiyami ba asum atuma. Asi awa adi ndishir ni kuu koˈ a, “Gur nga ti tir iti ayang.” Siwa gura nga ati tir abum ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesu na diba, “Ngga ti rip gina, amoˈ ayi Musa na tse, na war ra Arik ni Song shi aba nam ki didik koba nam ki mbombom ni? Ndishir aba ta vɨr gyoˈ, koba dar ka ni?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Asi awa arap ba ato boboˈ, tadi ndishira, “Nap koˈ mmi.” Si awa nap koˈa, asi koˈa ka wyer ananan. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ani Farisi nebi abi tsar siba vung nfu awowon, siba koma ta vung anereng atu yi kiyami ba nam ni Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Sar amun kop awur ne awaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Invi ma Yesu na koma ati wong tugbu ti aba ben. Na tsoˈ ming ibuu ma adibi ben Arik. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Mi ambwer na ngan na gyo amun kop ma aba nyi na wu, si awa sar awur ne awaa ming man na, ta adi ba, basi abi tum. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Asaˈ aman awa, Siman awa mi Yesu na sung wu saˈ Bitrus, nebi zuman Andarawus, nebi Yakubu, Yohana, Filibus, Batalomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiyu, nebi Toma, nebi Yakubu zu Halfa, nebi Siman, awami adi asini susun ku mmimi man, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yahuza zu Yakubu, nebi Yahuda Iskariyoti, awami ati ka dar Yesu ayoˈ abi kaˈ wu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam andishir nidum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu na aji ndo ne abi tum ama, bana aru atir abum. Abum ma amun kop ma na andishir nidum na ari koneni igar Yahudiya, ne Rushelima, ne igar ntun Taya, ne Sidon, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />abami na nyi ti aba awo wu, ti aba nam ba anero man. Na ya nam andishir abami asi ne anerim ambombom. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Boboˈ' andishir ati aba sa' wu koˈ, ti tsi ya ruri na wu, yabi nam ba boboˈ.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu na akama ato amun kop ma tadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">nyer yasi min, gina abi sang nga ki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ti gir Arik kasi min.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Gina abi anu didik mi gyong ya ti gina adza'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ati gina shir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Anu adidik kasi amin, gina abami gin adza'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">gina nyer.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Gina abi anu didik mi andishir ta kaˈ gina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">bati sar gina, ta muan gina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">bati kaˈ saˈ min tadi gina si ambombom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">atu yi Zu Ndishir.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Gina bi nyer arik awuma, gina bi zur tin nyer, ti achira amin ya mwe shu. Na sema anchinchim amin ba na nam abi reng ne antinte Arik abi kukup.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Nema anya min, gina abi ki koˈ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">gina nika min ta kun min wo.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Anya min, gina abami ni shir adzaˈa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ti gina ti wo gyong.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">“Anya min, gina abi nmuar adza'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ti adung gina ti nne shishir.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Anya min, boboˈ andishir ta gbar gina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ti sema anchichim amin bana nam abi reng ne antinte Arik abi mmu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta azidzenzor nyima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Ngga ban gina, gina abami wo ngga, gina bi ta adzidzen zor amin nyima, gina bi nik abi kaˈ gina anu didik. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Gina bi nik abi nmuan gina anu didik. Abi tun gina tsar gina bi ben Arik atu man. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Nung ta ngur wa tingtong gin wabi kam wu ku waa ma. Nung ta tawa antura ankpyaˈ, kɨr war wu bi tun antur ku ming nga sang. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Nik awami ta ben wa ki, wabi nik wu. Awami na tsoˈ ki mmi kɨr di aba agira nga baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Nam gin andishir kiyami gina ne tanyima aba nam gina. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Tasi mi gina nak nyer abami gina ni taba nyima ankyaˈ, anu adidik atama gina sima naka? Ti vung abi zup mbombom ba ta abami ba na taba anyima. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Tasi mi gina nyer nam abami ba nam gina ki didik ankyaˈ, gina ti nam are ti yik ki didik? Ti vung abi zup mbombom ba nam ama. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Gina nyer nik andishir kwar abami gina nne susun aba wang gina, gina ti nam are ti yik anu didik atu ma. Ti vung abi zup mbombom ba nik abi zup mbombom kwar ti aba wang ba ananan. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Nema gina bi ta adzidzen zor amin nyima ti nam ba gin ki wyer nang, gina bi nik kwar kɨr di aba wang gina baˈ. Gina yik ki didik mwema. Gina tiya si amumun Arik abi shuyi, awa sini nik ki didik ne andishir abi chinki ni abi zup mbombom. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Gina bi si abi ro susun, mi Ada min asi ni iro susun.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kɨr di gin nung na tara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Kɨr ti gin nung amoˈ, Arik masi bati ti gina amoˈ baˈ. Kɨr rop gin nung ba', gina min sima bati rop gina baˈ. Gina bi tso' gura awami na tara gina, Arik ati tsoˈ agura gina tara min. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Gina bi nik, ati nik gina kucha ashuma, ya ti wur var sher, ati kam mbira ashur gina koˈ antur. Kucha kami gina tsar andishira neka, asi ka ati tsar gina ma.<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu na nik ba ankpyeng awama. Ta di, nenfik ati gi gbur nenfik yi? Yi ti sema, gba' waa man ba ti jirasher dudu? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Amun kop abami na tsarba, ba ti gi nang ni tsar wu baˈ. Awami ata tsar wu awowon, ati simi ni tsar ru ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Asi ani dung wa to vin kpuki kami kasi iki zumin, ti ba wani to gbugbor kami kasi ming iki mi sang? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Asi are wa ti gi di zu min, wa zu mbor, dung ngga tun wa vɨn kpuki kami kasi iki mmi, ba wani gi yik gbugbor kami kasi iki mmi baˈ? Wa ni kamdir. Wa bi vung tun gbugbor kami kasi ki mmi aring, ti wabi yik awowon mi wa gi tun vɨn kpuki kami kasi ming ayi zumin.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agi kungkun itdo ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Kungkun ku wyer ba ka ti ido mumun mbombom baˈ, nebi nkunkun mbombom ba ka ti ido mumun yi wyer baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Agi nkunkun itdo ma. Bi yi ti aba nkpyeng bwap ikpa ku nchong baˈ. Bi yi ti aba nkpyeng inabi ikpa anjafufuˈ. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Ndishir didik agir kiki yi wyer aruma ming ki yi wyer yami na neya ari ming susun ma. Ndishir mbombom agir kiki mbombom yami na neya mbombom aru ma ari ming susun ma. Kiyami ya ru ri anu ndishir ya ri ming kiyami si susun ma.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andishir awaa abi mme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Ani dung gina gyo ngga ti, Atikop, Atikop, nema gina kaˈ nam kiyami ngga di gina bi nam? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Ndishir awami ta nyi ni ngga, ta wo reng mung, ta nam kiyami ngga ni di aba nam, ngga ti tsar gina mi ndishir ma asi. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Asi mi ndishir awami ati mme kop ma, na akau mmimima arira, ta saˈ nkpangting yi mme ma itu nkpang. Mi ancha ta ru, ta ngwur kop pa, nema bati gi nam kopa nung ba', ti bana mme ka mme didik. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Awami na wo reng mung, bana nam kiyami ngga ne di aba nam ba', asi ananan ni ndishir awami na mme kop, ba na kau mmimi ta saˈ nkpangting didik ba'. Mi ancha na ru, ta angwur kopa, adzaˈa sika jur. Jura tisi mbombom awowon.<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam gan nkpyaˈ ni rup akpa roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Mi Yesu na reng ater boboˈ wo ya andishir, asi awa rir Kafarnahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Asi gan awu ningur abi rop akpa Roma nung, Atikop ama anyer wu awowon, aro na dik tsap aba kuu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Na wo reng atu yi Yesu, asi awa atum aningur ani Yahuda anung aba ti ben Yesu, ti aba nyi ti nam gan ama ti aba wyer. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bana koma ni Yesu ta ben wu awowon, “Ai, awama nati wabi rak wuma. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ati awa na ta andishir ambor nyima ta aya amme kwara kop ku bing.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu na dzip ba. Mi na atip anyi kpap yi kopa, asi ningur atum adzidzen ama nung aba ban Yesu, wa Atikop, kɨr saˈ tumi je sang. Ba ngga ni mmar awami wa nyi kop mung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ngga ni nto itu mung ba ngga ni mmar nyi niwa baˈ, wati reng ankyaˈ gan amung ati wyer. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Nema ngga sini tsi yami abi rop akpa basi ayok amung. Ngga tin di awama, ba koma ati koma, ni ngga tin di awama, ba nyi na awa nyi, ngga tin di gan amung, nam ki yiya, na awa nam. <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu na wo ama, asi mis tu ma. Ta kam ma ato abami azip wu, ngga ban gina, ming Israˈila ba ngga ni yik nung awami asi ni zup didik yi tsi mi yiyama baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Asi abami na tumba bana kam angaˈ kopa, ati yik gan na wyer.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na gi zu uwa nikur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Bi ni agong baˈ, asi Yesu na koma ntun nung, agyo ya ti Nayin, amun koma ne andishir nidum na tsin ndo nawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Mi na tip anyi anutsir ku rir ntuna, asi anung agir kum Vɨnanzak nung aruma, asi awa ankyaˈ nyir iyama, asi uwa nikur. Andishir abi ntuna nidum ba dzip wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mi Atikop na yik uwama, asi awa ro susun ma, tadi uwama, “Dung gin na.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Asi awa tip akoma ta tuu atakpa ni kum ma, asi andishir abami agir wu siba gbur atir. Yesu adi, “Vɨnanzak ngga di wabi gur tir.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ni kuu ma na ngura song ta avung reng. Asi Yesu napwu anik iyama. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Asi ba shuma ni shishi boboˈ, ta gbar saˈ Arik tadi, “Awa ma asi ni reng ne antinte Arik nung nkpyaˈ na far aru ming mbor,” aba di, Arik na nyi ti aba ta andishira ma ashur. <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Reng ku kiyami Yesu na nam, ni rir koneni Yahudiya ne mung ntun yi kon na tong ama.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abi tum ari ne Yohana ne Baftisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Asi amun kop Yohana na ban wu kiki yiyama boboˈ. Asi awa gyo awaa ming man na. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Asiwa tum ba ne Atikop, aba ti rip wu, “Wa sine ti nyima yi, ko kwara bi saˈ ayi ni nung ni?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Mi bana rir ni Yesu, asi aba di, Yohana ni Baftisma na tum kwara bi rip wa, wa sine ti nyima yi, ko kwara bi saˈ ayi ni nung ni? <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Nkpang kukuma Yesu na tsoˈ agura andishir abi iro nidum ta nam ba ming ku sang nga gbegbereng man neni roman, neni anerim ambombom. Abi afik nidum na nik ba yik abum. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Asi Yesu tanyima tadi ba, gina bi kam koma ti ban gin Yohana kiyami gina ni yik, gina niya wo, abi anfik ayik, abi ngang ba tsin, abi ro ankpuˈ bana wyer, abi afik atong ba awo reng, abi kpyi na gur, na ya ban reng ku re ku abi sang nga ki. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Anu didik kasi ku abami baba na tar dza mbombom atu mung baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Gong ka abami Yohana na tum ba na kam akoma, asi Yesu avung reng ne andishir atu yi Yohana, awa adi, gina ni koma to ani ankwang? Gina ni yer bito agega rire kami mgbungbu fuk ka yi? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ta nak asima baˈ, gina ni koma to ani? Asi ndishir nkpyaˈ ni dong awowon yi? Oo, abi dong ti shur ntuntur yi ankor ba song awore man tatuk etum. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ti, gina ni ru koma to ani? Ni reng ni antinte Arik yi? Ai, ngga ban gina, na nang ni reng ne antinte Arik. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Yohana awami na tse atu ma. Ti ngga wa ti tum vin kop mung aba riti, awami ti nam wa tsir aring ti sin ka nyi.' <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ngga ban gina, ming min boboˈ nyir amba, ba awami asi nkpyaˈ anang Yohana. Nema awami asi tsap anang song Arik na nang wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Boboˈ andishir ne abi ta ankor mmimi na wo Yesu, asi aba ta nyima tadi si ananan tsir Arik kasi didik, ti dung nati ba baftisma yi Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Nema ani Farisi nebi nitsar amoˈ bana kak kiyami Arik atika nam atu man, asi aba kak dung Yohana aba ati ba Baftisma. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Asi Atikop aban tadi, asi ani ngga ti bing nga ne andishir abi nkpang kama? Basi mi ani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Basi mi amumun abi song dup, aba gyo akpaman, ta di, “Kwara ni vɨr ntup, gina ni kak zura. Kwara ni dok gina aron ayi kuu, gina ni kaˈ gin na., <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />To gin, Yohana ni Baftisma na nyi, bana ri kiri baˈ, bana so amashir inabi baˈ, nema gina di, Ai, asi ni anerim. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Zu ndishir na nyi ta ri, ta so, gina di, gina ni yik wu asi ni iri ti so awowon, adzidzen ama asi abi ta ankor mmimi ne abi nam zup mbombom. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ti si ama abami na ta ankpyeng ayi Arik anyima, bati gi yasi zup.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kop Saminu awuni Farisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Awuni Farisi nung na ben Yesu ri kiri kopma, asi Yesu akoma ta jisong ti aba ti ri. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Asi uwa nung ntuna ni zup mbombom, mi na awo Yesu adibi ri kiri kop awuni Farisi ma, si wa anyi ta gir tandu anyi nisi shishim. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ta tir gong ma iba ku adza ma ta dibi gin, asi amayi ama ya sher Yesu adza. Asi awa kin ni funfuk ituma, ta mang taya kin adza ma ni anyi nisi shishim. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Awuni Farisi ma mi na gyo wu, na yik kiyama, asi awa di susun ma, “Basi ndishir awama asi ni reng ne antinte Arik, ba gi uwa ma asi nga ti achoˈ wu koˈ. Ba ya gi, uwa ma asi ni zup mbombom.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu a tanyima tadi, “Saminu, ngga si ni ki yi ban wa. Ban ngga nitsar,” asi awa di. <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu adi, na ti ndishir nung azip andishira nung awaa kwar, gin dinari agina atung, ni waa ma soktung. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Mi bana wang araˈ akana, asi awa tsoˈ agur ba gbaˈ waa mana. I yik mi, nga wa ati ta nyima anang? <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Saminu adi wu, “I yik mung, awami na tsoˈ agur amwema.” Asi Yesu adi wu, “Wani ti amoˈ ananan.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Asi awa akam ato uwa ma, tadi Saminu, Wani yik uwa ama? Ngga ni rir kop mi, ba wani nik ngga amashir ni nara adza baˈ, nema awa na nar adza mung ne amayi ma, taya angoˈ ni funfuk ituma. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ba wa ni mang ngga baˈ mi ngga ni rir, awa ni rir ma bana dung mang adza mung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ba wa ni nuk ngga anyi itu mung baˈ, to awa na nuk ngga anyi nisi shishim adza mung. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Tasi ama ngga ban wa, zup mbombom ma yi mwe na tsoˈ aguru ma, ti na ta nyima amwema. Awami na tsoˈ agur ru ma tsap, awa na tanyima tsap. <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Asi Yesu adi wu, “Na tsoˈ zup mbombom mi agur wama.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Andishir abami ba dibi ri kiri ndo ba vung reng ne kpaman, “Awama asi nga, mi a tsoˈ zup mbombom agura?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Asi Yesu adi uwa ma, “Zup didik mmi ni ta wa gyoˈ, wabi ji keke.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Amba nung bana tsin ndo ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Gong kama, Yesu na dzip ntun nkpingkpyaˈ ni tsitsap ta dibi ban reng Arik nebi reng ku re atu yi song Arik. Amung kopma awur ne awaa ma basi ndo na wu, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />ne amba nung abami na kpab ba anerim ta nam ba ane ro man. Ming man Maryamu (agyo wu ti Magadaliya), awami na kpab wu anerim a tangba ari kpama, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yuwana uwa wu Kuza, Kuza awa si ningur nitum kop Hiridus. Neni Suzanatu, neni amba nung nidum. Amba ma bana vuu ki yi koˈ man, anam ani Yesu nebi amun koma ndum ma.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom ni bibi kami na tip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Mi andishir nidum ba dibi bing ri ntutun kankang ta nyi ni Yesu, asiwa anik ba ankpyeng ayama. <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Ni tip na koma tip bibi arum ama. Asi ming ku iyii bibi ma, asi nung ya roku tsir. Asi kwang nga, asi nunor abi shu ba sara. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Nung ya ni kpyeng sher itu kpayik. Mi yani ru si ya kur, ti ba amashir abuma. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Nung ya ni roku ming nchong, siba fur ndo, asi ankakiki amuera nang. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ni bibi nung yani roku ming mmimi didik, yani nik kpyeng agin na gin nang yami na dik atip pa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Mi na ban ama, asi awa gi kor tadi, “Nisi ne atong ayi wo, aba wo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Amun kop ma bana rip wu, asi ani ankpyeng ayama adi. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Asiwa adi, gina abama, na tanyima gina bi gi song Arik. Tasi mbira andishira, se ni ankpyeng. Bati sung ayi ti ba yik, nema baba ti yik baˈ. Bati shera atong, tiba wo, nema baba ti wo baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nanam aban ba atu yi gyom ni tip pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Kiyami ankpyeng ayama aban asi ya. Bibi ma, kasi reng Arik. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Tasi bibi kami ni roku tsir, kasi mi andishir abami na wo reng Arik, asi Nirem atsoˈ ka ngura asusun aman, ti kɨr aba ta nyima baˈ, tiba yik ta shur. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Bibi kami ni roku itu kpayik, kasi mi andishir ta wo reng, si aba ta ka ni nyer. Abiba ma, baba asi ne aring ba'. Bati tanyima yi vin nkpang tsap, mi tun tsar ti nyi, na aba tag zup didik man asher. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Bibi kami ni roku ming nchong, kasi mi andishir bami na wo reng, basi ming ku tsin man, ni nyer ki koˈ, nebi wop ki gong mmimi ni tsoˈ ba itu, yani mmuer ba nang, ti dung ba bana gi nik npyeng didik baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Bibi kami ni roku mmimi didik, kasi mi andishir abami na wo reng Arik, bana ta ka susun gin ta girka, ta tir mgbangbang, ta nam ndum ma naka ta nik npyeng.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki yi der ba ku songma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Ba wami ati mor kider ta kung nga ni rin, ko aba neya awoˈ kikur. Oo, se aba neya iba ku song ma, ti dung abami ati rir, aba yik der ra. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ti koneni yami ni sung rer ati bura aruma, ni kiyami na akung nga ati gira ruma baku der. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Gina bi nanam to mi gina wo ankpyeng. Ti awami asi ni ki, ati gyo' adom wu ma, nema awami atsoˈ basi ni kinung ba', ti vung vin yami ayik awa sima neya, ati taya ri newu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amun zumana ni Yesu ne iyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Iyama Yesu neni amun zuman bana nyi ti aba yik Yesu, nema ba bana gi tip koma nawu ba', ti andishir basi nidum. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Asi nung awa adi Yesu, “Iyami ne mun zumin aku tir abum, bati ba yik wa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Asi awa tanyima ta adi ba, “Iya mung ne mun zu mbor asi boboˈ abami awo reng Arik ta dzip ka.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na kya' mgbungbu yi amashir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Arika nung nga ma Yesu adi amun kop ma, “Kwara bi zor nya ti koma gong ku.” Asi aba agura rir gum nung ta vung zor. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Basi ming ku tsin, asi nna ya vung wu. Asi gbungbu mashir ya gur nya. Asi mgbungbu ya tur amashir ashur gum ma, mi gum ma kati jirim amashir, siba vung reng anne awowon. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Asi amun kop ma akoma ti shim wu, siba adi, “Atikop, Atikop, kwara ti dar.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Asi awa kama shim, ta tsing mgbungbu ma nebi nfu amashira, asi ya gbur tir ryot. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Asi awa adi amun kop ma, “Zup didik mina yasi ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Nema shishi ni tiba, kiyama ni tu ba susun awowon, tadi akpa man, Awama asi nga? Anik mgbungbu nebi amashir anu tiba dzip ki ban ma.<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam ndishir nesi ne anerim kpama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Mi bana rir ming mmimi Garasinawa, yami si gar andzang ni nya Galili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Mi Yesu na ji mmimi tong nya, ankyaˈ si nung ni ntuna awa na nyi nawu, asi ni anerim. Na amin adibi retan sang nga antur, nema ba song kop ba', awa nak asong baku agun. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Mi ndishira na yik Yesu, si awa aroku itima, asi awa agi kor kpankpang ta te akwa tadi, “Mmi ani ni ngga, Yesu Zu Arik ni Shuyi? Ngga ben wa, kɨr tun ngga tsar ba'.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ti Yesu naka amin atsing anerima aba wong aru ta dung ndishira. Ankpang nidum anerim ma amin na angur wu. Baya amin na rop wu ne aririˈ nkor adza ne yo', ne dza nung atiyen ropa. Anerim ma ba war wu gyo' ming ankwang mi ba nung. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu na arip wu, “Saˈ mi si nga?” Asi adi, “Nidum,” ti anerim ma ba mwe ming kpama. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Anerima ba vung ben Yesu kɨr aba dung ba koma ming ba ku dar ba'.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Abuma addi nidum ba dibi iri gar nkpang. Ankyaˈ anerim ma aba ben Yesu aba dung ba rɨr ming addi ma. Asi awa tanyima. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mi anerima na aruri ni ndishira, ta rɨr ming addi ma. Asi boboˈ addi ma ba gur ni tsur ta koma ming gar nya ku rim, asiba kpyeng asher ming nya ta kpyi. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Mi abi ber addi ma bana yik kiyami ni nam, asi aba tsura rɨr tsip, ni vɨn ntun ti ba ban kiyami bana yik. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Andishir bana dibi ru tiba to kiyami ni nam. Mi bana nyi ni Yesu, siba ayik ndishira awami anerima bana ru ari ma, na sung antur, ta ko song iti Yesu. Si shishi ya tiba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Abami na yik kiyama, asiba ban andishir mi ni sine anerima na ti ta wyer. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Boboˈ andishir gar Garasinawa siba ben Yesu aba dung ba mmimi man, ti shishi ni tiba awowon. Asi Yesu rir gum ku amashira, ta kama koma. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Ndishira awami anerima na aru ri nawu, na ben Yesu aba ta nyima awa ba dzip wu. Nema Yesu bana ta nyima baˈ. Ta diwu, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Kam koma kop, tika ti ban kiki kpingkpyaˈ ya mi Arik na nam wa.” Asi ndishira, koma koneni ming tsip ta dibi ban kiki ya mi Yesu na nam wu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na gi kum vɨnwa, ta nam uwa ni zor agi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Mi Yesu na kama nga ari nya, andishir nidum na ta wu, ti bana dibi ngup wu. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Asi ndishir nung ni saˈ Yayirus etum, ming ku ankpyingkpyaˈ kop ku bing Yahudawa, na nyi ta tar agbarung iti Yesu. Ta ben Yesu aba koma kop ma, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ti awa sini ivama gin ankyaˈ, awami asi ne amun ashe awur ne waa, ako kur anu ku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Mi Yesu asi ming ku tsin asi bing nga ya mmo wu kowuni gar. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Uwa nung asi ming andishira, na ti je ku iro ashe wur ne waa, adibi zor agi. Na nwun boboˈ ki yami asima naya bi wop auwu, ba awami na gi nam wu. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Na dzip gong Yesu si awa saˈ koˈ tong ter antura ma, asi abubuma zor agi ma gbutir chip.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu rip, “Asi nga atu ngga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Mi boboˈ' man bana atun, ankyaˈ Bitrus adi, “Atikop, andishir na kamwa gong kowuni gar, ta kung wa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Asi Yesu adi, “Nung na tuu ngga. Ngga ni wo tsi yani ru ri ni ngga.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mi uwama na yik Yesu na gi, bati ya sung rer ba', asi awa atip anyi ta wyir kpa, ta roku iti ma. Ta aban iti andishir boboˈ', kiyami ni dung awa na tuu Yesu, nebi mi na wyer abubuma. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Asi awa diwu, “Iva mung” zup didik mi, ni dung wa wyer. Wabi koma keke.<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Bana dzen areng ater ba', asi nitum nung awa ari kop Yayirus, ningur ni kop ku bing. Tadi Yayirus, “Dung gin nitsar aba song ashi, ti vami naka kuu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Mi Yesu na wo ama, asi adi Yayirus, “Kɨr ti shishi baˈ, wabi tanyima susun ankyaˈ, ati wyer.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Mi Yesu na rir kop Yayirus, bana dung nung na rɨr ndo nawu baˈ, anaˈ asi ne Bitrus neni Yohana neni Yakubu, neni ada ma vɨn uwama neni iyama. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Koni nga adibi gin ta ti ruru atu yi vɨn uwama. Yesu nadi, “Gina bi dung gin na, vɨn uwama bana kuu baˈ, ako kur nna.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Asiba amuar wu, ti bana gi ti vɨn uwama naka kuu baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesu na vung wu koˈ si awa gi kor tadi, “Va mung, wabi gur.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Si rim ma kam nga, na gur zagin. Asi Yesu adi ba, aba nik wu kinung aba ri. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Adida ma siba shur vɨr kiyami bana yik, nema Yesu na tsing ba kɨr aba ban nung kiyami ni nam baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na tum amun kop ma awur ne waa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Asi Yesu gyo amun kop ma awur ne awaa bing ba gin, asiwa nik ba tsi ne anu atu ayi boboˈ anerim, tiba ya nam anero kankang. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Na ya tum ba, aba koma tati ban reng ku song Arik, aba ya nam abi ro. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Naya diba, “Kɨr gina bi tsoˈ kinung gir atu yi tsin min, kɨr ya gir gin nkpuki, ni aporo, ni deng, ni ankor, ni antur awaa. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ni kop kami gina ti rira, gina bi jisong abum ma, se nkpang kami gina ti dung ntuna. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Nema, ba kami ta kak ta gina ma, tasi mi gina ti dung ntuna gina bi tur mgbungbuk yi adza min, ti yabi si ki ban, atu man.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Asi aba gur ta zip mun ntun, ta dibi ban reng ku re wo, ta aya nam abi iro koneni.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiridus na kpura dum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Asi nkpang nga Hiridus etum ni Galili, na wo boboˈ kiki yami tsin, asi wa reng nne awowon. Ti anung ba di asi Yohana ni Baftisma awa na gur ming abi kpyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Anung ba ya adi asi ni reng ni antinte Arik Iliya awa na far aru. Anung ba ya di, asi gin ming ku abi reng ne antinte Arik abi kukup na gur. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Asi Hiridus adi, “Yohana ama, ngga ni dung bana kpyeng wu itu. Asi nga awa, ngga ya wo kikiyama atuma?” Asi awa ti mi awa ti yik wu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na wok andishir agbugba tung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Mi abi tum ma bana kama nga, asi ba ban Yesu kap kiyami ba na nama. Asi awa tsok ba ki ma, ta koma ntun nung agyo ya ti Batsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Gong kami andishir bana wo asi amung nga, asi aba zip wu. Siwa taba nyima, ta ban ba reng atu yi song Arik, na aya nam abami wop aba wyer. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Mi arikagur nati, asi awur ne waa ma nyi nawu. Siba diwu, “Wabi dung andishir abama arir mun ntun ne mbir bubum yami yasi ayang nga, tiba wop kiri ni bubum yi kur. Ti iba kami kwara sima asi ankwang, ba andishir.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Nema na diba, “Gina, bi nik ba kinung aba ri.” Asi aba adi wu, “Kiyami kwara sima neya, deng tung ne ambe waa. Tasi ma, kwara ti koma ti rep andishir abama boboˈ ki ri.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Anurum ankyaˈ, bana war agbugba tung).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu na di amun kop ma, “Gina bi dung ba jisong akpaˈ soˈ tu tung.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Asi amun koma siba dzip ban ma, siba dung andishir boboˈ ba jisong. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Asi Yesu na tsoˈ deng tung ne ambe waa ma, siwa gi itu shu ta nyer Arik, ankyaˈ si awa tsika amwe, ta anik amun koma aba gap andishir. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Boboˈ man, bana ri shir. Amun kop ma, na vuu mbir ku dika, a shur ashu sisang wur ni waa.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus na ban, Yesu asi Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Arik anung ama, Yesu adibi ben awa na kpama, amun koma bana nyi nawu ibama. Asi awa rip ba tadi, “Andishir badi ngga si nga?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Amun kop ma ba diwu, “Anung badi wasi Yohana ni Baftisma. Anung badi wa si ni reng ni antinte Arik Iliya. Nema anung badi, wa si gin ming ku abi reng ne antinte Arik abi kukup si awa na gur.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Asi awa rip ba, “Nema ti gina pa, ngga si nga na gina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Bitrus ata nyima tadi, “Kristi, ni tun awu Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na reng atu, mi ati kuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Asi Yesu na tsing ba awowon, tadi kɨr ban gin nung reng kama sang. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Na aya adi ba, “Asima aba tun Zu Ndishir atsar bimban. Aningur andishir, abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ, ne abi tsar Musa, bati kaˈ wu. Ati nwun wu, arik ni tar, ati gi wu gura ri nebi kpyi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Asi awa diba boboˈ, “Tasi ma awami na tayima ati si vin kop mung, se na kak ituma, tiba tsoˈ angau ama kowuni arik ta zip ngga. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Tasima awami di awa ti ta vɨr ma gyoˈ, ati shuk ka. Ni awami bana kama to ta kyaˈ vɨr ma baˈ atu ayi saˈ mung, ati ta tuma agyoˈ. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Asi anu adidik atama ndishir ati yik, mi ta yik gong mmimi boboˈ ti aba shuk vɨrma? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Tasima awami ati shisha mung ne reng mung, Zu Ndishir ati ti shisha ma, nkpang kami ati nyi ming ku nkpyaˈ ma, nebi nkpyaˈ ku Ada, ne nkpyaˈ ku abi tum abi si tsetser.<verse eid="LUK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />“Ngga ban gina zup, anung abami aku tir ming ayang nga, baba ti kuu baˈ, se bana yik song Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na san kpama itu nkpang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Gong ku nvi tangdar yi ban reng kama, asi Yesu na tsoˈ Bitrus, Yohana, nebi Yakubu, bana wong tu nkpang ndo, ti aba ti ben Arik. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Mi Yesu asi ming ku ben Arik, asi iti ma kamsan, ntuntur ma ni te kɨkar pas, ya ni tsoˈ ayi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Basi auwa, asi andishir anung awaa Musa nebi Iliya siba far aru, ta vung reng ne wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bana far aru ming ku nkpyaˈ, asi aba reng ne Yesu, kiyama ti shuma atu yi kuu ma ming Rushelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Bitrus neni abami basi ndo, ba dibi wo re ku kur nna. Mi bana akama shim asi ba yik Yesu ming nkpyaˈ ma nebi andishira waa baku tir ndo nawu. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Mi andishira bana ti dung Yesu ta ti koma, asi Bitrus adi wu, “Atikop, ya wyera mi kwara si ayang nga. Dung kwara tar abur atar, gin kasimi, gin kasi ku ni reng ni antinte Arik Musa, gin kasi ku ni reng ni antinte Arik Iliya.” (Baba na gi kiyami aban baˈ).<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Bana zan na areng ater baˈ asi akpawur anyi ta kung ba. Mi akpawur na kung ba, asi amun kop ma ba ti shishi. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Asi aba wo kor ruri akpawura, tidi, “Awama si Zu Arik, Ni Sar amung. Gina bi wowu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Mi kora ni reng ama, asi ba yik Yesu na kpama. Amun kop ma bana gir kiyama ming akpaman. Nvima, ba bana ban nung kiyami bana yik baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam vɨvɨn nisi ne anerim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ambwer na nngan si Yesu ne amun koma siba aji ri tu nkpang, asi andishir nidum anyi ta marakpa na wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Asi ndishir nung ming ku bing nga na gyo ni kor nkpyaˈ, tadi, “Nitsar. Ngga ben wa wabi ro susun zu mung, awa si vɨvɨn amung ankyaˈ. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />To anerim nung naka min wong wu, ta dung wu ati akwa kpangkpang. Rima ya nguru, kpa ka wir wu, anuma ka tuk ka amfu. Ba ya dung wu baˈ, yasi ming ku ti dar wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ngga ni ben amun komi aba gir anerima arum kpa ma, ti ba bana gima baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Asi Yesu ata nyima, ta di, “Gina andishir abi nkpang mbombom kama, abi sang nga zup didik. Yi nkpang tama ngga ti song ne gina? Mi ngga rop susun ne gina? Gir vɨna nyima ayang.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mi vɨna ata nyi ni Yesu, asi anerim ma angur wu ataˈ agyoˈ mmimi, kpama ka vung wyir. Nema Yesu na tsing anerima, asi awa nam ivɨna, ta nap wu anik ada ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Boboˈ andishir abami nasi bama siba vung anu gir tsi yi nkpyaˈ ku Arik.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu na ya reng atu yi kuu ma</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mi andishir ba amis atu kiki yami Yesu na nam, ta ban amun koma tadi, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Wo gin ananan kiyami ngga ti ban gina adzaˈa. Ati kak Zu Ndishir ayoˈ andishir.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Nema amun kop ma ba bana gi kiyami aban baˈ, na sung ka arer ba. Asi aba ti shishi aba rip wu itu ku reng nga.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nga wa si nkpyaˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Asi antam ya agur ming ku amun kopa, atu yi nga wa si nkpyaˈ anang. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Mi Yesu na gi kiyami ba shuma atuma asusuna man, asi atsoˈ vɨvɨn nung, ta dung wu ati tir nnga wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Tadi ba, “Awami na ta vɨvɨn tsap, ni saˈ mung, na ta ngga. Awami na ta ngga, na ta awami na tum ngga. Ti awami asi tsap ming min boboˈ, asi awa sini si nkpyaˈ nang.” <verse eid="LUK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Asi Yohana adi, “Atikop, kwara ni yik nung adibi gir anerim ruma ne saˈ mi, kwara ni waru ma, ti ba sina kwara sang.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu na tanyima tadi, “Kɨr gina bi waruma sang, awami ta nak agbang kpa na gina baˈ asi amin.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andishir abi Samariya bana kaˈ ta Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Mi nkpang kani tip nyi ka mi ati tsoˈ Yesu ta akoma gbarshu, asi awa suntu ta koma Rushelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Asi awa atum abi tum aba riti, ta koma vɨn ntun nung yi Samariya, ti aba nam wu abum. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Nema andishira abi vɨn ntuna bana kaˈ ta wuma, ti na sun tutu ta koma Rushelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Amun koma Yakubu neni Yohana bana yik andishira bana nam ama siba di Yesu, “Atikop, wati tayima kwara bi ben Arik aba tum ni uwur kabi ri shu, ti iri ba?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Nema Yesu na kam ato, ta tsing ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Asi awa ni amun kop ma ba koma vɨn ntun nung.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiyami ti vung abi di aba ti zip Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Mi basi ming ku tsin tsir, asi ndishir nung ama adi Yesu, “Ngga ti zipwa iba kami wati yer ra.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu na tayima tadi, “Agugu aba ankwang basi ni adudu aman, mun nunor yasi ne anjen aman shu, nema Zu Ndishir basi ni abum ni kur baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Na di ndishir nung, “Zip ngga. Nema ndishir adi wu, Atikop, dung ngga ruu ada mung aring, tika sin zip wa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu na tanyima tadi, “Abami na kpyi aba ruu amun zuman abi kpyi. Nema wabi koma ti ban reng ku song Arik.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nung nga adi, “Ngga tiya zipwa, Atikop, nema dung ngga koma ti ndi andishira abi kop mbor se arika nung.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu na diwu, “Awami ati saˈ koˈ kar ku uwum randong, taya ato gong, bana mar song Arik baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na tum andishir soktangba ne waa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Gong kama Atikop na tum amun kop ma soktangba, ta gap ba awaa, awaa ntun ntun yami ati dzip. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nadi sher ya mwue, abi shera basi tsap, asiba aben Atikop ni sher, ba tur abi sher ankwang ama. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Koma gina, Ngga ni ntum gina mi awatam, ming agugu ba nkwang. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Kɨr tsoˈ gin ankor, nibi aporo, nibi akpadza. Kɨr tir ti tik gin nung tsir.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Tasi mi gina ti rir kop, gina bi vung di, keke ka bi song kop pa. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ndishir didik ta sima, keke kabi ji tu ma, nba ndishir didik ya bi kam koma gina. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Gina bi song kop pa, ti ri ti so, kiyami bana nik gina, tiya si ananan aba nik ni nam ndum achira ma. Kɨr san gin akop, baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Ntun yami gina ti rira, ata ta gina, gina bi ri kiyami bana nik gina. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Gina bi nam abi ro ntuna, tiya ban gin andishira, song Arik kani tim nga na gina. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Nema ntun yami bata kak ta gina nyima, gina bi tsoˈ tsir tsir tidi gin, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />Kota si mgbugbuk yi ntun min ya song kwara adza, kwara tura shur ba. Nema gina bi diba song Arik ni tip nga.<verse eid="LUK 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ngga ban gina, arik kama ati kun Sidom anang gina ntuna.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Anyia gina, Korasin, Anyia gina Batsaida, ki shishi yami na nam ma na gina, basi bana nama Taya nibi Sidon, basi gina ni min kam san ti dung nam zup mbombom gina bi sung akpoˈ ki ti kin tong itu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Arik ne amoˈ, ati gi ayi ato Taya nibi Sidon anang gina. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Wa Kafarnahum wa yik ati tsoˈ wa gi shu yi? Oˈo ati tur wa ta koma ting mmimi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />“Yesu nadi awami ta wo gina, nawo ngga. Awami ta kak gina na kak ngga. Awami ta kak gina na kak awami na tum ngga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amun kop Soktagba na kama nga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Mi amun kop soktangba bana kama nga ni nyer, “Tadi Atikop, vung amun anerim ba dzip kiyami kwara ban ni saˈ mi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Asi adi ba, “Ngga ni yik Nirem na roku ari shu mi inne. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Ngga ni nik gina tsi yami gina kwang yhwa ani irang, gina ti nang kiki yi nam adzidzen zor ami, ba kinung yami yi ti gina. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Nema, Kɨr nyer gin tidi amun anerim awo gina, gina bi nyer mi ta tse asaˈ min gbarshu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nyer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Nkpang kama Yesu na nyer awowon ni Rim tsetser, tadi, “Ngga ni nyer Ada, Atikop ni gbarshu nebi ni mmimi, wani sung kiyama rer abi ankpyeng ne abi bu ayi, ti tsar abami ba bana gi kinung baˈ. Ada, wani yik yini werwa ma.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Ada mung na nik ngga koneni. Ba awami nagi Zu sewa Ada, ba awami nagi Ada sewa Zu, nebi awami Zu Arik na tawu nyima ta tsaru ma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yesu na akam ato amun koma ta diba kontong, ayi yami yana yik kiyami gina ni yik, yasi na anu didik. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ngga ban gina Abi reng ne antinte Arik, nibi atum bati aba yik kiyami gina ni yik ka ba bana yika baˈ. Bati aba wo kiyami gina niwo ba bana wo baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki didik yami awu ni Samariya na nam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Nung nigi amoˈ Musa, awa nagur atir ta tsar Yesu, ta rip wu, “Nitsar, ngga nam are ti gi ta vɨr mung ti yik song ni song?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu na diwu, “Natse are amoˈ yi Musa? Yani ban ti di ani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Asi ndishira adi awa na gi, “Wabi ta Atikop mi Arik, ni susun mmi boboˈ, ni vɨrmi, ni tsi mi, ni song mi. Wabi ta zu min nyima mi tumi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu adi wu, “Wani ban ananan. Wati nam ama, wati song.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ni gi mgbanwu ma na tsar ituma awa na gi zup, tadi Yesu, “Nga wa si zu min?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu na diwu, “Nder nung na agura ri Rushelima ta tip aji ta koma Yeriko. Siba mara kpa nebi gip, siba tawu kiki, ta tsik wu, tsik mbombom, ta dung wu akur agbang kuu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ni tok ankpur na tsin, tsin, ma ta dzip tsira tayi ku ako kur si adzip gar gin ta gari kima. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Ankyaˈ nder nung awuni Lawi, naya dzip tsira ta yiku ako kur si adzip gar gin ta gari kima. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Asi nder nung wuni Samariya adzip abuma. Mi na nyi ta yik ndishira, siwa ro susun ma. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Ta koma nawu ta kin wu anyi, ni amashir inabi ta dibi rop wu ashishi ma. Ta tsoˈ wu saˈ ngam ama, ta gir wu takoma ba kukur ta nik wu awu. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ne mbwuer na tsoˈ dinari waa anik ni kopa aba to wu, tadi ngga ti nga kiyami wani nwun ngga ti ka wang wa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Yesu na diwu, ming ku adera atar abama, nga wa ming man wani yik asi zumin nibi wami na rir ayok abi gip?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Nigi mkpangwu ma adi wu, awami na ro susun ma. Yesu adi wu, “Wabi koma tika bin nam ama.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na koma ni Marta nibi Maryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu na amun kop ma basi ming ku tsɨn, na rɨr vin ntun nung, asi uwa nung ni saˈ Marta na tawu ane kop ma. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ti asi ni iva man agyo wu ti Maryamu, asong iti Atikop ta wo reng ma. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Marta ndum ne tsoˈ wu tu, asi akoma nawu tadi “Atikop, bawa ni kamto baˈ, iva mbor awa na dung ngga ndum ma kiki mung? Ban wu tidi aba rak ngga ma.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Atikop na tanyima tadi, “Marta, Marta. Susun mi nigur, kiki nidum. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Asi ki gin awop pa. Maryamu na tun kiyi wyer, ba awuni ati gi tawu neya.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Tsar Yesu atu yi ben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Arika anung ama Yesu adibi ben banung kama. Mi na ter, asi gin ming ku amun kop ma adi wu, “Atikop, wabi tsar kwara ben, mi Yohana na tsar amun kop ma.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Na diba, tasi mi gina ti ben, gina bidi, Ada nisi gbarshu, aba gir saˈ mi tsetser, etum mi kabi nyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Nik kwara kiri yami kwara wop yi aring, aring nga. <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Wabi tsoˈ kwara zup mbombom mbor, mi kwara tsoˈ gura abami na tara kwara. Kɨr gir kwara ti dung nirem ba rem kwara ni kiyami kwara roku baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu na aya di amun kop ma, aba di gin ming min asi ni dzen, na koma nawu ne tsutsu buu tadi wu, dzen, wabi nik ngga kwar deng mi tar. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Ti dzen amung nung awa na ri tsin ta anyi ngga ya adzaˈa. Ba ngga sini kiri yami ngga ti nik wu baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Dzena mi ama ata nyima ri ming tar, tadi, Kɨr kpur ngga baˈ. Ngga nika min kung anutsir. Ngga ne amun na mung, kwara ni ka jikur. Ba ngga ti gi gur ti nik wa kinung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ngga ban gina, kota si bati gur ta nik wu kinung mi asi dzen ama baˈ, ti shisha yati te wu, ati ra saˈ ma, mi aba gur ta nik wu kiyami awop. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Ti ngga ya ban gina, gina bi dibi ben bati nik gina. Gina bi dibi wop gina ti yik. Gina bi dibi ngwur ati bu gina. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Awami ta rip, ati nik wu, awami ta wop ati yik, tasima awami ta ngwur ati bu wu.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Ada tama ming min, mi zuma ta ben wu ambe, ti ba nik wu yhwa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Koba ben wu nkpangkuko ti aba nik wu irang <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Gina andishira ambombom, gina ne gi nik amumun amin shisha yi wyer, Tiba di Ada min ni shu ati nik Rim ma abami na ben wu sang yi?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Ba'alzabul tum anerim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Arik anung nga ma Yesu na dibi gir rim ndishir ne anfikatong ruma. Mi anerim mbombom na ru, asi nefikaton nga areng. Andishir abi si bama, siba ti shishi. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Asi anung ming man adi, “I, ni tsi Baˈalzabul etum anerim na gir anerim mbombom aruma.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Anung bana ti aba tsar Yesu, siba diwu aba kam mbir kami ti tsar, aba di tsi ma ya ri ne shu.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Nema Yesu na gi asusun aman, si adi ba, “Andishir abi etum kami ni ngar etum ma kati jur, kop kami ni ngar, kop pa kati sher var. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Tasi mi Nirem ta tsik mgbu ni akpa ma, etum ma ka ti tir yi? Ngga ni ban ama, ti gina ni di, ni tsi yi Baˈalzabul ngga ni gir anerim ruma. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Tasi ni tsi Baˈalzabul ngga gir anerim ruma, ti, amun kop min pa, ni tsi yi nga gina gir anerima min ruma? Atu ayama bati te gina amoˈ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Tasi Ngga ni tsi ya Arik ngga gir anerim ruma, etum ku Arik kani nyi gina.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Tasi mi ndishir ni tsi na kor agbandung ama, ta ber kop ma, kiki yi kop ma ati song keke. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Tasi nung ta nang wu ni gbegbereng ta tsik wu nang, nawa ta agbandung awami saˈ ayi ma nawu, ati vuu kiki yi kop pa agap.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Awami basi ni ngga baˈ, asi dzen zor amung. Awami ba na rak ngga bing nga baˈ, awa ashera var.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamkoma rim shishir kpa ku ndishir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Rim mbombom, mi ti wong ru ni ndishir, na ya retan bubum kukur, na ya wop baku song shi. Mi yati wop araˈ kana, na ya di ituma, ngga ti kam koma kop kami ngga ni ru rima. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Mi yati kam angaˈ ti yik kopa na kun ka tsetser ta nam ka. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Nema ati koma ti gir anerim anung atangba, abami na nang wu bi nam zup mbombom, bati rir ta jisong ming ma. Tong tera, song ku ndishira ka ti chokra nang ku iti.<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyer yi zup didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Mi Yesu asi ming ku reng, asi uwa nung ming andishira nidum, agi kor tadi, “Arik ba nik anu didik uwa awami na nyir wa, ti wani mang kye ma.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu na tanyima tadi, “Ai, abami awo reng Arik, ta aya dzip ka asiba si abi anu didik.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andishir ba di Yesu ba nam ba ki shishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Mi andishir ba dibi bing nidum nawu, asi Yesu adi, “Asi nkpang mbombom ka. Ba wop aba yik kinung, nema bati tsar ba kinung baˈ, se yi Yunusa. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Mi Yunusa na si kinung ne andishir abi Nineba, sema ngga Zu ndishir ti si kinung ne andishir abi nkpang kama. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Arik ni ti amoˈ ayi tong ter, Etum amba ni shin ati gur ndo ne andishir abi nkpang kama, ta ti ba amoˈ ta rop ba. Ati nyi ari tong ter gong mmimi tiba wo apyeng ayi Suleimanu. To gin awami na nang Suleimanu awa ayang. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Andishir abi Nineba bati gur tir arik ne ti amoˈ ndo na andishira abi nkpang kama. Tiba ti ba amoˈ, tiba rop ba. Ti baba na san ta dung zup mbombom mi bana wo reng Yunusa. To, gin awami na nang Yunusa awa.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kider yi kpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Ba awami ati mmor kider ta sung nga arer, koba neya awok adem. O'o, se aba sa'a iba ku song ma, ti abi rir aba yik der ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ayi ami yasi ki ter yi kpa mi. Tasi mi ayimi ta wyer, boboˈ kpa mi kati shuma ni der. Tasi mi ayimi na tara, se kpa mi kabi shuma ni buu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Nema, wabi to der yami si ni wa, yasi buu yi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Tasi boboˈ kpa mi kati shuma ni der, ba baku ti buu tsap amin, kati der sher mi ki yi der ya der sher wa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ngan ani Farisi ni abi tsar andishir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Mi Yesu na reng ater, asi awuni Farisi na ben wu ri kiri kop ma. Mi na yer, ako song bi ri kiri ma, ba na nar ayok baˈ mi nam mana. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Asi awuni Farisi ma, asi awa angar anu mi ayik Yesu adibi ri kiri ma, bana nar ayok baˈ mi nam mana.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Atikop na diwu, “Gina ani Farisi abama, gina nar gong agbugba, nema nne min ni shuma ni zup mbombom ni mwuer abum. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Gina arurur. Ba bana gi awami na nam gong abuma asi awa na nam ming nga sang yi? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Gina bi nik kiyami gina sima neya shisha, abami ba sang nga mana ya. Ti kiyami gina ti nar tibi si tsetser iti Arik.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Anya, gina andishir abi Farisi. Gina nik Arik gin ming ku wur ming avunvu ayi arampa ayi yii ning boboˈ. Nema gina ni ka' kam to bi nam zup didik ti tanyima ne Arik. Asi kiki yiyama gina bi nam bing ni yuyu ma.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Anya, andishir abi Farisi. Gina ta nyima aba nik gina baku song didik kop ku bing Yahudawa, tiba ya tik gina yi shuyi idup. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Anya min. Gina si mi agun ayami ba yik ka ba', ayami andishir ba tsɨn ituma sang nga gi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Asi gin ming ku abami tsar amoˈ Musa adi, “Nitsar, wati ban ama, ai, kwara ma, wani mmuan kwara mbor si.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu na tanyima tadi, “Anya min abi tsar amoˈ Musa, gina ni rop andishir kiki yami ya ri, yami ya ro ba tsoˈ. To gin, ba gina ni nap vɨvɨnkoˈ min ti raˈ ba tsoˈ baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Anya min, gina ni mme agun abi reng ne antinte Arik, abami anchichim amin bana mmi ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Nema gina ni ban ne tumin kiyami anchichim amin na nam. Bana mmi abi reng ne antinte Arik, gina ni ya mme agun na man. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Asima, Arik ming ankpyeng ma nadi, ‘Ngga ti tum ni, abi reng ne antinte Arik amung ne abi tum amun kop. Bati mmi anung aman, anung bati tung ba tsar.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Tasi ma ati rip andishir abi nkpang kama, kwar ku agi abi reng ne antinte Arik abami na mmi ba, tsoˈ ri nkpang kami na nam gong mmimi, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />tsoˈ ri agi Habila ti koma agi awu Zakariya, awami na nwun wu atsutsu ba ku gbu nkawu nebi ba kusi tsetser ming kop Arik. Zup, ngga ban gina ati rip kwar agi ma, ne andishir abi nkpang kama.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Anya min abi tsar amoˈ Musa, gina gir kibu tsir yi kop ku gi. Gina tu min ba gina ni rir baˈ, ba gina ni dung andishir abami na tayima aba rir baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Mi Yesu na dung abuma, asi abi tsar amoˈ Musa ni andishir Farisi, siba mmo wu, siba dibi tuu wu susun ti aba reng atu yi kiki nidum. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Asi ba shuru ayi ti aba vung wu anereng ma mi ati ka ban.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Tsing abi ruk abum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mi andishir nidum abi war agbugba na bing, ta kwang akpa man, asi Yesu reng ne amun koma. Ta diba, gina bi nam shesher ne antu awu ani Farisi, ni kamdir man. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ba kiyami na kung nga yami ba ati bur ra aruma baˈ, nebi ba kiyami ni sung rer yami ba bati gi yika baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Tasi ma, kiyami gina ni ban na ni buu, ati woya arik nider. Kiyami gina ni ban na sung rer, kota si ming tar ta kung nunu tsira, ati ban anereng atuma ari akpukpap.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awami ati ti shishi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Gina adzidzen amung, ngga ban gina kɨr ti gin shishi abami ati nwun kpa nema gong kami ta anwun wu ba kinung yami ba gi nam ituma. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ngga ti ban gina awami ati ti shishi ma. Gina bi ti shishi Arik, gong kami na nwun, asi ne tsi yami aba tok wa agyoˈ ming uwur. Ngga ban gina Zup, gina bi ti shishi ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ba ti rep mun nunor tung kirbi waa baˈ? Tasi ma Arik ba na ngwur kowuni gin ashi baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Kota si funfuk itumin naka ban na boboˈ. Kɨr ti gin shishi, ti gina wyer nang mun nunor shashan. <verse eid="LUK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Ngga ya ban gina, ti awami na ta ngga nyima iti andishir, Zu Ndishir ati tawu nyima iti abi tum Arik. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ni awami na tun gi ngga iti andishir, ngga mung sima ti tun gi wu iti abi tum Arik. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Nebi awami ta reng atu yi mmuar Zu Ndishir, ati tso' aguru ma, nema awami ta reng atu yi kaˈ Rim yi Arik, ba bati tso' aguru ma baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Tasi mi na gir gina ta koma kop ku bing, ko iti abi rop, ko iti etum, kɨr gina bi di gina ta atumin shur ni tsi, ni kiyami gina ti ban, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />ti Rim Arik yati tsar gina kiyami gina bi ban nkpang nga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom ni rurur nisi ni kikoˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Asi nung ming andishir adi Yesu, “Nitsar, wabi tsing zu mbor aba nik ngga kiyami si mung ming ku kikiyami ada mbor na kuu ta dung nga.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu na tayim ma tadi, “Wa, nga na diwa bi sine ti amoˈ ko ngga bi sine gap gina kiki yami ada min na kuu ta dung gina?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Asiwa di ba, “To gin! Kɨr gina bi di gina bing atu min kiki nidum, ti ba siya si vɨr baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Asi awa nik ba ankpyeng anung tadi, Na ti ndishir nung nisi ne ki koˈ awami arum ama na nik npkyeng awowon. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Na vung shum susun ma, ta di, “Ba ngga sini abum ni shur npyeng yi arum amung boboˈ baˈ. Ngga ti nam are?” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Siwa di itu ma, ngga ni gi ki yi nam. Ngga ti jir agbu yama, ti mme anung ankpingkpyaˈ, ti shur boboˈ npyeng ya arum amung ni kiki mung ming nga. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ngga ti di susun mung, “Ngga sini kiki nidum yami ngga ti wore ashe ni nidum. Dung ngga song shi, ti dibi ri, ti dibi ya so, tiya wo re mmi.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Nema Arik nadi wu, wa rurur. Buu yiyama wati kuu. Tiba to asi nga wa ati ri kikiyami wani bing ne itumi ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu na reng ater tadi, “Ti sima ne awami ati bing tuma kiki, tasi iti Arik basi ne ki koˈ baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kɨr gina bi ti je</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Asi Yesu adi amun kop ma, ta sima ngga ban gina, kɨr gina bi ti je atu yi vɨr min, ni ki yami gina ri, nibi tuntur yi sung kpa min. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ti vɨr ni nang ki yiri, kpa kani nang ntuntur. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Gina bi to rirideng. Baba tip koba di aba sher, ba baya sine atar ni nne ki yiri ko agbu, nema Arik anik ba ki ri. Wyer min ka nang nunor shashan. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nga wa ming min atu yi je, ati gi gyoˈ ndom ma nkpang gin vɨr ma? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Tasi mi, gina ti nak ti gi nam kinung tsap mi yiyama baˈ, ti asi ani dung gina saˈ atumin je ni mbira? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Gina bi to mi hure ya fur. Ba bana nam ndum, ba bana rok kinung baˈ, ba bana nam atu man tuntur baˈ, nema ngga ban gina koba si etum Suleimanu nkpyaˈ ni dong ma boboˈ bana nang gin ming man baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Tasi mi Arik ati dong agiga ya ankwang ama, yami ya sima aring, ambwer tiba tok ka gyoˈ atsitser wur, tiba di gina? Gina abami zup min ni kornyin. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Kɨr gina bi dibi shum atu yi kiyami gina ri, ni kiyami gina so, kɨr gina bi ti je. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Tasi andishir abi gong mmimi abi sang nga gi Arik, ba dibi wop boboˈ kiki yiyama. Gina ba, Ada min na gi ki wop min. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Gina bi ne susun min song Arik, ati nik gina boboˈ kiki yayama.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsar atu yi bing kikoˈ shu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Kɨr ti gin shishi, gina mun ngbar mung, ti Ada min anyer aba nik gina song Arik. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Gina bi rep kiyami gina sima neya, ti gina bi nik abi sang nga ma neya. Gina ti nne atu min aporo ne ankor mi bati tser baˈ, yasi kikoˈ yami bati chokra ba shu, mi bani gip awami ati gipa, ni ba dan awami ati chok ara. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Nema iba kami aporo mi asima, abuma susun mi ka sima.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agan abi song nnwup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Mi gina song nwup, ti kider min bi dibi der. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Gina bi song mi agan abami ba nwup atikop man aba nga ari baku gang yi rop nga. Mi na nga ta kum tsir, asi ba abu wu. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Anu adidik kana song gina agan abami atikop ata nga ati yik basi tsitsir. Zup, ngga ban gina, ngga ti tun antur ankpyaˈ amung ti nam ndum, tidi gina bi jisong ti ri ki ri, nema ati dzip itu ku koni nga tiba gir wu ki yiri ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Kota nga ni atsutsu ibuu, kota si ne ambwerbwer, tiba yik ba ko song anwup, agan na asi abi anu didik. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Nema gina bi gi, basi mi atikop ati gi nkpang kami ni gip ati nyi, aba song tsitsir, bati dung wu aba rir ta chok kiki ara wu kop baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Gina ma bi song tsitsir, ti Zu Ndishir ati nyi nkpang kami gina si auwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gang didik ni nisang nga nam didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Asi Bitrus arip, “Atikop, wa ban asi kwara ankpyeng ayama, koya si ayi koni nga ni?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Atikop na di, nga wa asi gan didik ni gi ankpyeng ayama, awami atikop ma ati ba dung wu basi ningur ni gir kop ma, ti aba ya nik mbir agan na ki yiri ananan nkpang? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Anu didik ka tisi ni gan awami atikop ma ati nyi ta yik wu na nam ndum ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Zup, ngga ban gina, ati dung wu aba to wu kiki ma boboˈ. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Nema in gan na tadi susun ma, atikop mung ta gong bi nyi, na awa ba vung tsik mbir agan na, anurum ne amba, ta rir ri ti so, ti aba akwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />atikop awu gan na ati nyi arika awami gan song auwa, nkpang kami ba bati gi baˈ. Atikop pa ati tsik ku tsik mbombom ta rop wu ming ku abi sang nga zup didik. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Gan awami na gi kiyami atikoma nadi aba nam, nema bana namma baˈ, bana aya zip kiyami atikop ma na ban baˈ, ati tsik ku awowon. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Awami bana gi kiyami atikop ma nadi aba nam baˈ, ta nam kiyami na mar aba tsik ku, ati tsik ku tsap. Ti awami na nik wu ki yi mwe, ati yik ki mwe ari nawu. Awami na ya nik wu ki yi mwe awowon, ati ya wop ki mwe ari nawu. <verse eid="LUK 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Ngga ni gir wur nyi tibi shur gong mmimi. Basi yik mung, basi naka moˈ ka. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ngga sine baftisma yami ba ti ngga, ngga wa tir susun gbangbang har se bana ti ngga naya. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Gina ni tsoˈ ngga ni gir gina song kusi keke gong mmimi? O'o, ngga ban gina, asi dung akpa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Tsoˈ ri adza'a, kop gin andishir atung bati ngar kpaˈ waa, atar bati kaˈ awaa, awaa bati ya kaˈ atar. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ada ati ka zuma, zu ati ya kaˈ ada ma. Iya ati kaˈ vama, vama ati ya kaˈ iyama. Iyama ruma ati uwazuma, wazuma ati ya kaˈ yamma ruma.” <verse eid="LUK 12:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu na ya adi andishir, “In gina ti yik akpawur gur ri arikagur, gina di, ati ku awur ni shu, siwa aya ku. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Nebi gina ti yik mgbungbu gur koˈ ri, na gina di ati wu abum, se aba ati. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Abi kamdir. Gina ni ya gi kiyami tsin gong mmimi nebi gbarshu, nema gi tonter ku nkpang kama, ya nang gina.<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dus gin ni niti amoˈ ami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Asi ani dung ba gina te tumin amoˈ adidik sang? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />In nung ata gir wa ta koma ba ku ti amoˈ iti aningur, wabi nam andanda ti gina bi dus mi gina si tsir. Ta kaˈ, ta gir wa ta koma iti ni ti amoˈ. Ni ti amoˈ ati ya nap wa nik vin nirop. Vin nirop ati ya gyoˈ wa jaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ngga ban wa, bawa ru abuma baˈ se wani wang boboˈ ankor yami na rop wama.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Dung nam zup mbombom ko wa bi kuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Asi ananan nkpang kama, andishir anung abami asi abuma na ban Yesu reng ku andishir ani Galili mi Bilatus na dung agi man na kpuradum. Na mmi ba nkpang kami ba dibi tok Arik ankpur. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu na tayima tadi, “Gina yik na mmi andishir ani Galili abama, gina tsoˈ bana nang mbir andishir abi Galili zup mbombom yi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ngga ban gina baya sima baˈ. Tasi mi gina ti nak kam san, ti dung nam zup mbombom baˈ, boboˈ min gina kpyi mi man na. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ko gina to andishir awur ne tangdar abami mme yi wur ni roku ituman Siluwam ti mmi ba. Gina tsoˈ, ba na nang mbir andishir abi ntun Rushelima zup mbombom yi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ngga ban gina ba yasi ama baˈ. Tasi mi gina ti nak kam san, ti dung nam zup mbombom baˈ, gina ti kpyi boboˈ min si.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na tsar atu yi bwap ni kaˈ ndo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Asi Yesu na tsar ba nkpyeng yama. Tadi, “Nati ndishir nung awami na tip nkunkun bwap arum inabi ma. Asi awa nyi ti ba kpyeng ndoma, nema bana yik kinung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Tise ama ngga di ndishir awami asi ni ber arum inabi ma, to gin, aring nga, she ku tar ka, ngga dibi nyi bi wop ndo nkunkun bwap ba. Ti kowuni nkpang ba ngga ni yik kinung ituma baˈ. Chem ka tak gyoˈ. Ani dung ka gang mmimi shisha?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />“Nema ni ber ankwang nga na tayima tadi, Atikop, dung ka ma aring yi she gin, ti ngga kau tin nga kam gong, ti shur ka atsu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ka ti ndo she ku nyi, ya ti wyer. Ba ka ti nag ndo baˈ, na ba chem ka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam uwa ni dan gong arik ni song shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Nvɨ yi Song shi nung nga ma Yesu adibi tsar kop ku bing nung, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />asi uwa nung awa mi anerim bana saˈ wu ro ta dung wu na dan gong yi ashe wur ne tangdar, ba gi nap baˈ ko tsap pa min. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Mi Yesu na yik wu, asi wa gyo aba nyi iti. Ta diwu, “Wakop, na tsoˈ wa romi.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Asi wa saˈ koˈ ma itu uwama, ayang ne yang asi uwama nap ananan, siwa gbar saˈ Arik.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Nema ningur ne kop ku bing nga, na ti nfu awowon mi Yesu na nam uwama arik ni song shi. Asi wa adi andishir abami basi ibama, “Nvi tani yasima yi ndum. Tasi ama, gina bi nyi ming nvi yama, ti ba nam gina. Kɨr gina bi nyi arik ni song shi sang.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Atikop na diwu, “Gina bi kamdir, asi nga wa ming min, ba juk randong ama ne kpok jaki ma, tiba gir ka ta koma iba ku ri arik ni song shi sang yi? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Uwama, ari ming kop ani Ibrahim awami Nirem na rop pu, aring ashe awur ne tangdar, bisi ananan aba nam wu arik ni song shi sang yi?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Mi na reng ater ama, ni dung boboˈ abi kak wu, asi shisha ti ba. Nema mbira andishir bana yik wu asi nkpyaˈ atu yi ki shishi yama boboˈ mi adibi nam.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom awu mgbyeng masta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Asi Yesu arip, “Asi are song Arik ka tisi? Ngga ti tsar ka ne ni? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Song arik kasi mi mkpyeng masta mi yasi tsap, yami ndishir nung na tsoˈ atip ankwang ama. Asi ka fur ti te nkunkun, nunor bana roˈ anjen shu anggaˈ ama.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom ne kinung mi agyo yati antu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu na aya rip, “Ngga ti bing song Arik ne ni? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Kasi mi antu awami uwa nung na sang nga bing ni mumung alkama, ti dung antu ma na nam ndum ti mumung nga ni wun.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anu tsir moo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Asi Yesu avung tsin ti koma Rushelima, na dzip mung ntutun nebi ane tsip adibi tsar andishir reng Arik. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Asi nung arip wu tadi, “Atikop, atisi, andishir tsap ankyaˈ bati yik ta shur yi?” Yesu na diwu. <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Gina bi tir ngbangbang ti rɨr gin ming anutsir moo, ti andishir nidum bati nama aba rɨr, nema ba bati gi rɨra baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Tasi mi atikop pa, ta nang agur ta kung anutsir kop pa, ngina ti nyi ti tir abum, ti dibi kum gin anu tsira, gina ti dibi ben, Atikop, bu kwara tsira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">“Awa ti tanyima tadi, ‘Ba ngga ni gi ba kami gina rima baˈ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Tasi ama gina, vung di, mi kwara ni ri ti so ndo niwa, wani tsar ntuntun mbor. <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />“Awa ti di, ba ngga ni gi ba kami gina rima baˈ. Gina bi dung ngga, gina abi nam zup mbombom.<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />“Abuma, gina ti gin ti nwum anyin. Ti yik ani Ibrahim, nebi Ishaku, nebi Yakub, ne boboˈ abi reng ne antinte Arik ako song, song Arik. Ati war gina ashur abum. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Andishir bati nyi ari andzang, nebi arikagur, shu, nebi shin, ba ti song bi ri kiri song Arik. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />To gin, abi tongter aba tisi abi iti, abi iti aba tisi abi tongter.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na gin na mayi atu yi Rushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Nkpang kama ani Farisi anung bana nyi siba adi Yesu, “Wabi dung ayang nga, ti koma iba nung, ti Hiridus awa wop tsir aba nwun wa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu diba, “Gina bi koma ti ban gin ni agugu aba ankwang ama tidi, ‘Ngga ti vung kpap anerim ruma ti nam andishir aring nga ne ambwer. Virku ngga sin ter ndum mung kami ngga ti nam.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Yasi ananan ngga bi sin vung tsin mung aring nga, ne mbwer, nebi virku. Bi yiti wyer aba di ni reng ne antinte Arik, aba kuu banung, inta nak asi Rushelima baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Anya, andishir abi Rushelima, gina abami ni mmi ni reng ne antinte Arik, ti ya taˈ gin andishir abami na tum ba na gina. Adza ben ngga ni ti ngga bi bing gina mi kuko abing amumun ma ming anggu ma, nema ba gina ni tanyima baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />To gin, na dung gina kop min ako, Ngga ya ban gina, ba gina ti ya yik ngga baˈ, se arik awami gina tidi, ‘Anu didik kaba song, awami ati nyi ming ku saˈ Atikop.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam ndishir ni iro uwu kpa arik ne song shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Arik ni song shi anung ama, asi Yesu na rir kop nung ku ningur ndishir awuni Farisi ti aba ti ri kiri. Andishir ba na shuru ayi ti ba to, kati nam kiyami biyi niti aba nam arik song shi ba'. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Abuma iti Yesu ndishir nung awa adzama ne ayoˈ ama yana wuu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Mi Yesu na yik wu, asi arip abi tsar amoˈ ne andishir abi Farisi ta di, “Amoˈ na tayima aba nam ndishir ni ro arik ni song shi, koba dung ni?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Nema ba bana di kinung baˈ. Yesu na tuu ndishir ni roma taya nam wu, ta diwu aba koma kop kima.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ayang nga Yesu na rip andishir tadi, “Tasi nung ming min zu ma nebi randong ama na roku mbwi arik ni song shi, ba gina tunu abubuma sang yi?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Asi ba wop ki nam araˈ akana rip ma.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsoˈ tumi bisi kinung baˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Mi Yesu na yik anung ming andishir abami na gyo ba ri kiri ma, bana sar ron yi wyer, asi Yesu aban ba ankpyeng awama. <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Nung ta gyo wa gang yi rop nga, kɨr koma kuti jisong iba ku song andishir ankpingkpyaˈ sang. Tasi mi na gyo nung awami asi kpyaˈ anang wa. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Nta sema ndishir ni gang nga awami na gyo gina gbaˈ waa min ati nyi ta diwa, ‘Nik, ndishir awama ron mi.’ Wa yik, ati nik wa shisha, wati kam koma iba ku song mi ba si ku ankpingkpyaˈ baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Nema ata gyo wa gang, wabi ti tun iba ku jisong kami ba kasi ku ankpingkpyaˈ baˈ. Ti dung awami na gyo wa ta nyi, se aba diwa, ‘Dzen amung nyi ti jisong ayang, iba ku jisong andishir ankpingkpyaˈ.’ Yi yama ti dung mbir andishir abami na gyo ba, aba gbar wa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Tasi ndishir awami ta tsoˈ tuma awa si kinung, ba bati to wu ashu koˈ baˈ, awami ta jitu ma agyoˈ, ati towu ashu ayi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Asi Yesu kam ato awami na gyo ba gang yi ri kiri, “Tasi mi wa ti gyo andishir bati ri kiri, wabi gyo adzidzen ami ankyaˈ ne amun zumin amba ne anirum, ne anting amin, ne abi bing song abi kikoˈ. Nwati nam ama, arika nung bati ka gyo wa man si. Nema bati wang wa kiyami wani nam ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Tasi mi wati gyo andishir gang, wabi gyo abi sang nga ki, nebi gbur mimi nebi ni gyoˈ dza, ne abi anfɨk. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Nwa ti nam ama, Arik ati nik wa anu didik. Arik ati wang wa, arika awami ati gi abi nam zup didik ri nebi kpyi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom abi nyi gang nkpyaˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Mi ndishir nung ming ku abi rɨ kiri na wo ama, asiwa adi Yesu, anu didik kasi ni awami ati rɨ kiri yi gang yama song Arik. <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu na adi wu, “Na ti ndishir nung mi na nam gang nkpyaˈ, na gyo andishir nidum. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Mi nkpang ku gang ni ti, asi awa tum gan ama aba koma ti ban abami na gyo bama, ‘Gina bi nyi naka nam koneni si ananan adzaˈa.’<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />“Asi boboˈ man avung ban basi ni kiki yi nam. Ni gin na di, ‘Ngga ni sin ta rep ankwang, dung ngga yer bi to mi asima, ngga ben wa, wabi vung susun.’<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />“Nung awa adi, ‘Ngga sin ta rep randong yi wum mi wur. Ngga si tsir ku koma nam ndum ma neya to. Ngga ben wa bi vung susun.’<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />“Nung awa adi, nvi yama ‘Ngga sinta ta uwa, atu yiya ma ba ngga ti yik nkpang ku yerra baˈ.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Gan na na kama nga ati ban atikop ma boboˈ kikiyami na ban wu. Nfu ni niti atikop pa, asi awa adi gan na, ‘Koma andanda, ti dzip tsitsir ne afofor ayi tsip, wabi ban abi sang nga ki, ne abi gbur mmimi, ne abi anfik, ne abi gyoˈ dza wabi gir ba nga ayang.’<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />“Mi gan na na kama nga, tadi, ‘Atikop ma, ngga ni nam kiyami wani ban, nema mbira abum ka sima mi adzaˈa.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />“Atikop pa nadi gan na, ‘Wabi koma anetsir ankpingkyaˈ ne atsitsap, wabi tur andishir ba nyi, ti kop mung kabi shuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ngga ban gina, ba gin ming andishir abami na agyo ba, awami ati re kiri mung ato.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Je kami kati vung abi zip Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Arika anung nga ama andishir nidum bana dzip Yesu, asi awa kam ato ba tadi, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Awami ati dzip ngga, ta nak ata ngga yimma anang ada ma ne iya ma, ne uwa ma, ne amumuna ma, ne amun zu man ne mun iva man, ti vung vɨr ma baˈ, bati gi si vin kop mung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Awami bata nag atsoˈ angau ama ta dzip ngga baˈ, ba ti gi si vin kop mung baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Nung ming min ta ti mme tar ku shu, ati jisong aring, ta aba tse kiyami mme ma ti ri, tiba to awa asi ni ankor ayami ti maru mme ter. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ta naˈ agi nam ama baˈ, ta saˈ nkpangting nga, ti bana mme ter baˈ, boboˈ andishir abami na yik mme ma ba ti gyap wu, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />bati di, ‘Ndishira awama na vung mme, nema bana gi nam ka ter baˈ.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Ti aba di etum nung, na gur ti aba ti kum ne etum nung. Ati jisong ta reng ta shum atuma aring sang yi? Ti awa asi ni abi rop akpa agbugba awur, ati gi ti kum ni etum awami, asi ni abi rop kpa agbugba soˈ waa yi? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nta si mi bati gima baˈ, tsoˈ ri mi basi gbangbang aba min na tum anung aba ti yik ku, ti aba ben tsir ku song keke. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Yasima koni nga ta nag adung kiyami asima ne ya baˈ, bati gi si vin kop mung baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang yami biya re baˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mang ya wyer, nema yati dung rema, ati nam are ti rema bi kam nga? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ba ya sine ndum nung mmimi nebi atsu baˈ, se aba ta asher ankyaˈ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">“Awami asi ne atong ayi wo, aba wo.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Gyom awu wantam ni dar awami na yik ku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Arika nung nga ma abi ta ankor mmimi, nebi andishir anung mansi abi zup mbombom, bana dibi bing ni Yesu, tiba wo wu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Asi andishir ani Farisi nebi tsar amoˈ mi bana yik ama, siba dibi ruka abum tadi, “Hai, ndishira awama ata bi zup mbombom, aba ri ki ri abing ndo na wu.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Asi Yesu ban ba ankpyeng ayama. Ta di, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Aba di nung ming min asi ni awantam agina, asi agin na dar. Ati dung soˈ tris ne tris ibama, tiba koma ti wop awami na dara, se na yiku sang yi? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nta yik wantama, ati nyer, ati tsoˈ wu saˈ agakto, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />ti ba akam akoma kop. Tiba gyo adzidzen ama ne abami ba song ndo na wu, tiba diba, ‘Gina bi raˈ ngga nyera. Ti ngga ni yik wantam awami na dara.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ngga ban gina, nema ati nyer awowon shu,mi awami na kam san ta dung nam zup mbombom ma, ati nyer nang andishir soˈ tris ni tris, abami bana tsoˈ atuman basi abi zup didik.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom awu ankor ayami na yik ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Aba di uwa nung, awa asi ni ankor kirbi mi wur, gin ti dar. Bati mor ki der ma, tiba rir bubum, ta kun kop ma, ti ba dibi wop ka awowon, se na yik ka ring sang yi? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Mi ta yik ka, ati bing adzidzen ama nebi abami ba song ndo, ta diba, ‘Gina bi raˈ ngga nyera, ti ngga ni yik kirbi ayami na dara.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ngga ban gina, yiti si ma, ati nyer iti abi tum Arik mi gin na dung zup mbombom ma ta kam asan.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom awu vɨn ni dar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu na vung reng ta adi, “Nati ndishir nung awami asi ne mun nirum awaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Vɨn tsap ming mana na adi ada man, ‘Ada, wabi nik ngga kiki mung adzaˈa.’ Asi ada man agap ba kiki ma akpaman.”<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />“Mi bi yini gong baˈ, asi vɨn tsap abing kiki ma boboˈ ta gur, akoma mmimi nung gbangbang. Amung nga mi na koma ti ta ankor ara ming ku song ma bi ti gbungbu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Gong kami na ri kiyami na sima neya boboˈ, asi mbombom gyong ka rɨr boboˈ mmimima, asi awa vung sang nga ki. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ti sima, awa koma bi wop ndum ni ndishir nung ni mmimima, asiwa tum wu bati ber wu ane addi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Na wop aba shu nne ma ni anfur nkunkun yami ane addi ba ri. Ba awami na nik wu kinung.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />“Mi susun ma ni kam nngaˈ, asi awa di itu ma, ‘To abi nam ndum ne ada mung nidum ba ri shir ta dung mbira. Tiba di ngga wa ti kuu gyong ayang.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ngga ti ngur koma ni ada mung ti diwu, ‘Ada, ngga ni tara Atikop Arik ni shu, ne wa misi. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Biyi ti aba ya gyo ngga ti zu mi baˈ. Wabi dung ngga bisi gin ming ku agan abi nam wa ndum.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Asi awa gur ta vung tsir, ta koma ni ada ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Tsoˈ ri mi asi gbangbang, asi ada ma ato wu gi, asiwa avung ro susun ma. Ta gur ni tsur, ta koma ati kpap zuma gir, ta dibi nyin wu gir.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Asi vɨn na adi, ‘Ada, ngga ni tara Atikop Arik ni shu, ti ya nam wa misi. Ba ngga ni mar aba ya gyo ngga ti zu mi baˈ.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />“Nema ada ma na gyo agan na ma, ta diba, ‘Andada. Gina bi gir antur ankpyaˈ aku wyer nang, aba sung wu. Gina bi sung wu vɨna ankawun vɨn koˈ, gina bi ya sung wu akpadza adza.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Gir gin randong ni nkpong, aba waˈ. Ti kwara bi tang, ti nyer. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ti zu mung ama, na ka kuu, nema adzaˈa awa na kam angaˈ. Na di' adar, adzaˈa na yik ku. Siba vung nyer awowon.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Mi asi ming ku nam ama, zuma ningur nasi ankwang. Mi na atip anyi kop, asi awa wo ba dibi doˈ aron, ne angkpɨm ayi zur. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Asi awa gyo gin ming agan abi kopa, ta rip wu asi ani ya tsin.<verse eid="LUK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />“ ‘Asi awa adi wu, Zu min tsap na angaˈ,’ awa ta nyima, ‘asi ada min adung ba vung randong nisi ni nkpong ama waˈ, ti zu min na angaˈ kop keke.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Nema zu man ningura na ti nfu awowon, ta kaˈ rɨr kopa. Asi ada ma awong aru ta ben wu aba ri ming kopa. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Nema siwa tayima ada ma, ‘To boboˈ ashe ayama, ngga dibi nam wa ndum mi gan, ba ngga ni zen kaˈ bang mmi ba. Ba wani zen nik ngga ko vɨn gugu tin gyo adzidzen amung kwara bi tang neba baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Nema mi zumi ama awa na ngaˈ, awami na koma ti var kiki mi ater atu yi kilaki, na ngaˈ kop wani waˈ wu randong awami asi ni nkpong.’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Asi ada ma adi wu, zu mung, kowuni arik kwara si ndo ni wa, boboˈ kiyami ngga sima neya yasi mi. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />‘Yini ti kwara bi nyer tiya ti nne kikar, atu yami zu min ama awami naka kuu, adza'a awa na ngaˈ tsitsir, na dik ka dar, nema na yik wu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Gyom ni tum nkpyaˈ ni sang nga zup didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu na ban amun kop ma, “Na ti nung ni sini ki yi koˈ, awami aningur avɨm wu, tadi ba gi gir ki yi koˈ ya atikop ma baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Asi atikop ma na gyo ni nam tum ama, ta rip wu ta di, ‘Ani ngga wo itu mi? Wabi sini gir ngga kiyami wa ni tse yi ndum mi. Ati ba wa ti ya si nitum amung baˈ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />“Asi ni gir abuma adi susun ma, ‘Atikop amung ati war ngga baku ndum, ngga ti nam are? To gin, ba ngga sini gbegbereng ku wum baˈ, ngga ti shisha yi ben <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ngga ni gi kiyami ngga ti nam, nta war ngga bi sini gir abuma, ti dung andishir aba ta ngga akop aman.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Asi awa gyo andishir abami atikop ma adzip ba kwar. Ta rip ni gin ta di, ‘Asi niya atikop mung adzip wa?’<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />“ ‘Na di, garwa anyi mi agina atangdar.’ Nitum nkpyaˈ na di, ‘To mgbangwu ku kwar mi ka, wabi nam andada ti jisong ti tse agin na nas.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />“Na ya di nung, ‘Wa pa, azip wa ani?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“ ‘Asi awa diwu, katanko alikama mi agbugba gin.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Awa tayima tadi, ‘Ta mgbanwu ku kwar mi ka, wabi tse agina tangdar.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Atikop na gbar gan nkpyaˈ ni sang nga zup didik, ti awa na tsar ankpyeng ming kiyami mi na nam. Ti andishir abi mkpang kama ba gi gir andishira man, nang andishir abami asi der. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu na vung ban tadi, ngga ya ban gina, gina bi ti adzidzen ni abi sang nga zup didik ni ki koˈ min gong mmimi. Nema, ki koˈ ti ter, ati ta gina ane akop ayami gina ti song rima.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />“Awami na mar aba tawu nyima ki tsap, ati ya tawu anyima ki nkpyaˈ. Awami asang nga zup didik iki tsap, ati sini sang nga zup didik atu yi ki mwe. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Nba gina ti nam zup didik ni ki koˈ yi gong mmimi kama baˈ, nga ti tanyima aba nik gina nne ki koˈ yi zup didik? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ngina ma ti nag nam zup didik kiyi nung baˈ, nga ati nik gina kiyami si min?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Ba gan awami ati gi nam atikop awaa ndum. Wa kaˈ gin, ti ta gin na nyima. Ko aba nam gin na ki didik susun gin, ti aba mar ni gin na. Biyi ti gina bi nik susun min bi dzip Arik ti gina bi ya saˈ ayi atu yi ankor nkpang gin.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiki nung yi tsar Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Andishira bi Farisi abama asi abi nyer ankor, mi na ban ama, siba dibi diwu ti nchur. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Nema Yesu na diba, “Gina tsar atumin ayi andishir, tidi gina si andishir adidik. Nema Arik na gi asusun amin. Kiyami andishir ba yik ya wyer, yasi ki bur iti Arik.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Kiyami si ming amoˈ Musa nebi yi abi reng ne antinte Arik asiya andishir adzip ti nyi nkpang ku Yohana ni Baftisma. Ni nyi ma, na vung ban reng ku re wo ku song Arik. Koni nga na mo kpa ma, ti ba yik rir ming. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Nema, yati nang aba di shu nebi mmimi bi dar, ne aba di kpukpum gin yi amoˈ Musa bi nang dar.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsar Yesu atu ayi nwun nnga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Boboˈ awami ta gyoˈ uwama ta tanung, na nam zup mbombom yi kur ni uwa nung. Boboˈ awami na ta uwa awami ruma na gyoˈ wu, na nam zup mbombom yi kur ni uwa nung.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom ni sini ki koˈ aba ni Liyazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Na ti ndishir nung nisi ni ki koˈ, awami agi sung kiki yisi na ankor, amashira shishen awu galura, ne kiki kɨkar pas. Awa aya sine pwir kowuni arik. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Na ti nung ni sang nga ki, ni saˈ Liyazarus. Awami kpama nak ashishi. Amin na tsoˈ ni sang nga ki, ati nne anutsir kop nisi ni pwir ama. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Awa song asaˈ ayi mbir kiri yi var sher, yi ndishir ni ki koˈ ma tiba niku aba ri. Ban ni yaya ma, agwugwu ba nyi ta dibi re ashishi ma.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Tong tera, asi ni sang nga ki kuu, abi tum Arik siba tsoˈ wu, ta gir wu ta koma ni Ibrahim. Ni ki koˈ na ti kuu masi, na aya ru wu. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Rim ma ni koma amung ming uwur mi baka rim baˈ. Asi ming ku je, asi wa agi itu ta yik Ibrahim gbangbang, ni Liyazarus agar ma. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Asi awa gyo ni kor kpyaˈ tadi, ‘Ada, Ibrahim, wa bi kun ngga, ti wabi tum Liyazarus aba sung vɨvɨn koˈ ma amashir, tiba te kyoˈ ngga rirem mung, ti ngga si ming ku je ming uwur kama awowon, ti ngga bi wo vɨn shima, ti ba kami ngga sima asi ming wur.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Asi Ibrahim ban, ‘Zu mung, shum nkpang kami wani dibi wo re mi, wani ka ta kiki mi yi wyer. Awa Liyazarus na ta kiki mbombom. Adzaˈa awa song awo re, wa song te je. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ban ni yaya ma boboˈ, tsutsu mbor na gina. Gbugbor ngboˈ kami ba awami ati gi tokka nge ri ayang nga ta koma ni gina, nebi ba wami ati gi tokka nge ri amung ti ngaˈ ayang.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />“Asi ni ki koˈ ama adi, ‘Ada, ngga ben wa, wabi tum Lazarus aba koma kop ada mung, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ti ngga sini amun zu mbor atung. Aba koma ta ti nwun ba, kɨr aba nyi ayang nga, ibaku ti je baˈ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Ibrahim na tayima tadi, ‘Amung zumin basi ni ngbangwu Musa ni ku abi reng ne antinte Arik, aba wo kiyami angbangwu ma ban.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Nisi ni ki koˈ na tayima tadi, ‘O o, ada mbor Ibrahim, nta si nung ta gur ari gun ta koma, neba ba san zup mbombom man.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />“Ibrahim adiwu, ‘Nta si mi ba bati wo reng kami agbangwu Musa nebi abi reng ne antinte Arik baˈ, ko tasi nung ta gur ari ming ku abi kpyi, ba bati wo wu baˈ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na tsar atu yi zup mbombom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu nadi amun kop ma, “Kiki yami ti dung andishir ajira sher zup mbombom ya ti nyi. Anya awami tisi ni gir kiki yama nyimma. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Awami ati dung gin ming ku amumun abama aba roku, ni nang aba kor wu nkpang yi koˈ itoma tiba tok wu agyoˈ ming nyaˈ. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ta sima gina bi to atumin ananan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Nden zumin na tara wa, wabi tsing wu. Nta kam san, wabi tsoˈ aguru ma. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nta si na tara wa adza tangba arika gin, asi wa kam asan ta angaˈ ni wa adza tangba ta di, ‘Ngga ni tara wa.’ Ko wa ti kak, wa tsoˈ aguru ma.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amung kop na ben Yesu ba mme zupdidik man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Asi abi tum na di wa Atikop, “Wabi mme kwara zup didik mbor.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Atikop na tayim bama tadi, “Mi gina tisi ni zup didik yami niti mi gyom ni mkpyeng masta, yami si tsap nang ming ku bibi boboˈ gina tidi nkukun kum nkpyaˈ kama, ‘Wabi tun tumi ayang nga, ti koma ti tip tumi ming nyaˈ.’ Kati dzip kiyami gina ni ban.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndum ku gan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Aba di gin ming min asi ni gan, awami awum wu, ti aba aya akam wu awantam. Nga wa ming min, mi gan na ta ngaˈ ari ankwang, ati diwu, ‘Namma, ti ngaˈ ti jisong ti ri kiri’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ba ti diwu, ‘Nam ngga kiri yi rikagur aring, ti ngga bi ri ti so, aring wabi sin ri mi ti so sang yi?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ati nyer gan na mi na nam ndum ma kami na di aba nam? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Yi sema ne gina, gong kami gina ni nam boboˈ kiyami si ananan, gina bi di, ‘Kwara si agan abami ba kwara ni mar kinung baˈ. Kwara ni nak nam ndum mbor ankyaˈ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam abi Ankpuk Awur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Arika anung nga ma Yesu atsin na koma Rushelima asi awa dzip wong ku mmi Samariya nebi mmi Galili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ati rir vin ntun nung ya, asi abi ankpuˈ mi awur siba amara akpa newu, ta tir shan. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Asi aba gi akor tadi, “Wa Yesu, Atikop, wabi kun kwara ma.”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Mi Yesu na yik ba asi adi ba, “Koma ti tsar gin itumin ni abi tok ankpur tiba yik gina.” Siba si ming ku tsin tsir ankyaˈ asi nam ba.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Gin ming mana na yik awa na wyer, asi awa akam akoma ni Yesu, ta dibi gbar Arik ni kor kpankpang. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Na nyi ta jido mmimi iti ku Yesu, ta nyer wu. Awa asi ndishir awuni Samariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu na rip, “Ndi asi andishir awur na nam ba? Mbir atiris ase? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ani ni dung asi tsin awa ma ankyaˈ na kam ngaˈ te aba ti gbar saˈ Arik?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Asi Yesu adi wu, “Gur koma kimi, zup didik mi ni dung wa ni wyer.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mi Song ku Arik ka nyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Andishira abi Farisi anung bana rip Yesu nkpang kami song Arik kati nyi, siwa adi ba, “Nanam to, song Arik basi ne ayi ati yik ka baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Ba awami ati, di toka ayang, ko aba di toku amung. Ti song Arik kasi ming min.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Yesu na adi amun kop ma, “Nkpang kati nyi kami gina ti gina bi yik arika gin ming nvi yi Zu Ndishir, nema ba gina ti yik baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Andishir ba di gina, ‘To ka amung,’ ‘To ka ayang.’ Nema kɨr gina bi tsur dzip ba gin baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Arik awami Zu Ndishir ati ya kam angaˈ, ati si mi nne ya der ri shu, ti sher tongter ku gong mmimi kika ti koma kuku. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Nema se na vung ti je awowon aring, mi andishir abi nkpang kama ba kaˈ wu.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Yi tisi mi, ni nam nkpang ku Nuhu, ti sima nkpang ku Zu ndishir. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Andishir bana dibi ri ti so, anirum bana ta amba, ta nik amumun aman ngah, har arika awami Nuhu na rir gum, asi awur anpyaˈ agur ta dar mbir andishir boboˈ.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />“Asima yani si nkpang ku Lot. Andishir ba ri ta so, aba rep ta vuu rep, aba tip kiki kankang, aba mme akop. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Nema arika awami Lot na ru ntun Sidom, siba shur nkpang yi wur ari shu ti gbu mbir andishir, boboˈ.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Yati si ama arika awami ati tsar Zu ndishir abum. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Arika ma, awami asi itu tar kɨr aba ji tadi awa nyi bi vuu kikima ming kop. Nema awami ta koma ankwang, kɨr aba ngaˈ bi tsoˈ kinung kop baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Gina bi shum uwa Lot. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Awami ati aba ta vɨr ma gyoˈ, ati wop ka rak akana, nema awami ata kak vɨrma, ati yik ka. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ngga ban gina, buu yami kiyama ti nam ati yik andishir awaa baku kur kikur gin, ati tsoˈ gin, ta dung gin. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Amba awaa ati si baku koˈ gbu ndo, ati tsoˈ gin, ta dung gin.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />(Andishir awaa bati si ankwang, ati tsoˈ gin ta dung gin.)<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />“Asi ani Atikop?” Ba rip Yesu. Se awa tayima ta di “Abum awami kum kasima, asi bama ankpang ba bing nga.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Gyom awu wanikur nebi ni te amoˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Asi Yesu anik amun kopma ankpyeng anung, awami ati tsar ba mi bati min aben kowuni nkpang, kɨr aba dɨk baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Nadi, “Ni te amoˈ ntun nung awami ba ti shishi Arik baˈ, ba to andishir basi kinung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ntunna asi uwa nung awami ruma naka kuu na dibi koma na wu, ta ben wu tadi, ‘Wa bi tsar ngga zup, ming ku amoˈ ayami ya si itu mung ni dzen zor mung.’<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />“Vung ri nkpang nga. Na kak, tong tera na di susun ma, ‘Ko mi ba ngga ti shishi Arik baˈ, ba ngga to andishir basi kinung baˈ,’ <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />nema ati uwama ba dung ngga baˈ, ngga ti dzip wu kiyami ya sima, ti nam wu zup amoˈ ama, ti tsin nyima kɨr bi dung ngga dik baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Asi Atikop adi, “Gina wo kiyami ni te amoˈ ni sang nga zup didik na ban. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nta sima Arik bati wang andishir abami na sar ba, abi ben buu ne arik, Ati gong baku nam ba zup yi? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ngga ban gina, ati nam gina zup didik andanda. Nema Zu ndishir ata ngaˈ, ati yik andishir abi si ni zup didik gong mmimi kama yi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom awu ni Farisi nebi ta ankor mmimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu na ya ban nkpyeng yama atu ya andishir abami ba saˈ ayi aba si adidik iti ku Arik, aba to mbir andishir boboˈ ba si kinung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Andishir awaa anung abami bana rir kop Arik ti ba ben. Gin ming mana asi awu ni Farisi, gina asi ni ta ankor mmimi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Asi awu ni Farisi ma agur tir adidik siwa avung ben tadi, ‘Arik, Ngga ni nyer wa, ti ba ngga si mi nbira andishir abi sang nga gi Arik, abi gip, abi mmuer abum, abi zip amba. Ba ngga si mi ni ta ankor mmimi ma baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ngga rop anu adza awaa nvɨ, ngga nik gin tu ku wur ming ku kiyami ngga ni yik.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Nema ni ta ankor mmimi natir gbangbang bati ma gi ayi ato shu baˈ. Na saˈ ayok asang ama ti ba tsar shishir nne ma, adi wa, ‘Arik, wa bi ro susun mung, ti ngga sini zup mbombom.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesu na di, “Ngga ban gina si ananan, ni ta ankor mmimi na koma kopma ta yik song kusi tsetser iti Arik, basi mi awu ni Farisi baˈ. Nema awami ta tsoˈ tuma awa asi ki, ati gir wu ajima. Nema awami ta jituma agyoˈ, ati towu ashu yi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nik amumun anu didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Nkpang nga andishir anung ba dibi gir amumun aman ti Yesu aba nik ba anu didik. Mi amun kop ma na yik ama asi atsing andishir. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Nema Yesu na gyo amumun atsitsap aba nyi na wu tadi, “Gina bi dung amumun atsitsap aba nyi ni ngga, kɨr war gin neba baˈ. Song Arik kasi ku andishir abami basi mi man. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ngga ban gina zup, awami ta nag ata Song Arik mi vɨvɨn tsap baˈ, bati gi rir ming nga baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nisi ni ki koˈ nebi song arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ningur Yahudawa nung na rip Yesu tadi, “Ni tsar didik, ngga nam are ti yik vɨr ku song ni song?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />“Asi Yesu adi wu, ani dung wa gyo ngga ti ndishir didik?” “Ba wami asi didik anaˈ asi Arik ankyaˈ. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Wani gi kiyami bang ni di, ‘Kɨr zip amba baˈ. Kɨr nwun nung baˈ. Kɨr gip baˈ. Kɨr ta reng ni nmu baˈ. Wabi zip kiyami ada mi nebi iyami aban wa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />“Boboˈ kikiyama ngga ni min dung nga tsoˈ ri ngga si vɨn nanzak mi aring.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Mi Yesu na woma, siwa adi wu, “Na dik wa ki gin. Rep kikiyami wa sima na ya boboˈ, ti nik abi sang nga ki ankor ra, nema wati nne tumi aporo gbarshu. Ti nyi kati zip ngga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Mi na wo ma, asi susun ka rang wu awowon, ti awa asi ni ki koˈ nidum. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu na yik susun ni rang wu, asi awa di, “Ya ti roma ni ankor aba rir song Arik. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Tasima biyi ti roma aba di lakurmi aba rir bwe ki kwan nebi awami asi ni kikoˈ aba rir song Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Abami na wo ma siba rip, “Nta sima nga wa ti yik ta gyoˈ?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu na tayima, “Kiyami ndishir bati gi nam baˈ, ni dung nang Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Asi Bitrus adi, “Kwara ni dung kiyami kwara sima neya ti zip wa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />“Yesu na diba, Ngga ban gina,” Yesu adi zup, “Ba awami ati dung kop, ni uwa ne amun zuman anirum ne amba, nebi adida atu yi song Arik, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ti aba di na sang nga yik kiki adza a nidum, mkpang kama. Mkpang ku nyi ti aba yik vɨr ku song ni song.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ban mi ati kuu dza ku tar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu na gyo amun kopma awur ne awaa abama tong ta diba, “Kwara ti wong koma Rushelima abuma, bobo kikiyami abi reng ne antinte Arik na tse atu yi Zu Ndishir yati shuma. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ati nap wu anik abi sang nga gi Arik. Bati pwar wu, ta mwan wu, ta aya ruk antite shur wu. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bati tsik wu, ta aya nwun wu. Arik ni tar aba ya gur.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Amun kopma baba na agi kiyami reng kama mi Yesu aban ba baˈ. Na sung ating ayi reng kama arer ba, Nema baba gi kiyami areng atu ma.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nam nefik ni ben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Mi Yesu na atip ngaˈ ntun Yeriko, sine fik nung awa ako song bi ben tong tsir. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Mi na wo bing ya andishir gari, siwa rip asi ani nam. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Siba adi wu, “Yesu awuni Nazaret agari.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Si nefika agi kor ma kpangkpang tadi, “Yesu, Zu Dawuda, wabi ro susun mung.”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Abami basi itima atsing wu tadi wu aba ti ryot. Nema asiwa nanam agi kor kpangkpang tadi, “Zu Dawuda, wa bi ro susun mung.”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Asi Yesu gbutir, siwa anik anu ta di aba gir ndishira anyima newa. Mi ndishira na atip anyi, si Yesu arip wu, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Ngga bi nam wa ani?” Asiwa adi wu “Atikop, ngga bi yik abum.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu adi wu, “Wabi ta yik abum. Zup didik mi ni wyer wa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Abobuma, sewa yik abum. Sewa vung zip gong Yesu, awa agbar Arik. Mi andishir boboˈ na yik ama, siba mansi, agbar Arik.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na ta Zakka gyoˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu na rir Yeriko, ta tsin agari ming ntuna, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Asi anung awa si nkpyaˈ ni ta ankor mmimi, ni saˈ Zakka. Asini ki koˈ, <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />na ti awa ba gi nga wa si Yesu ma, nema bana gima baˈ ti asi vin nkpuk, ti andishir na ti dum. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ankyaˈ awa ari ti ni tsur, si awa ayik nkunkun bwap ta wong, ti awa ba yik wu, ti Yesu ati zip abuma.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Mi Yesu na nyi abuma, asi agi tuma shu ta di, “Zakka, wa bi nama ti ji. Aring nga, ngga ti jisong kop mi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakka na nam andanda ta ji, ta tawu ni nyer. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Andishir na yik ama, siba boboˈ areng anne, ta di, “Awa na ti song kop ni nam zup mbombom.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Asi Zakka gura tir adidik, ta di Atikop, “Wo ngga ayang, Atikop, ngga ti nik mbir ki kok mung abami asang nga ma neya. Dug awami ngga ni tawu kinung, ngga ti wang wu adza nass kikiyami ngga ni taya nawu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Asi Yesu adi wu, “Aring nga, ta shur ni nyi kop kama, ti awa asi zu Ibrahim. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kiyami Zu Ndishir na nyi andinding nga tiba wop kiyami ni dar, tiba ya taya shur.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom ni pank wur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Ba si ming ku wo kiki yama, Yesu na dibi ban ba ankpyeng anung, andishir bana tsoˈ song Arik ka si aza'a za'a, mi Yesu na atip nyi Rushelima. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Asi awa adi ba, na ti ndishir kpyaˈ nung awa mi ata koma ntun nung yisi gbangbang dung aba nyin wu etum, tiba kama angaˈ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Na ti koma na gyo agan ama ami awur ta nik koni tama pank wuwur, ta di ba, Gina bi kam ayok a na ya se ngga ni ngaˈ.<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Andishir abi ntun na bana kak wu atu yema, siba tum amun abi tum gong kami na koma ta di, ba kwara ni ta nyima ndishir ama abasi etum ma mbor.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Asi gong kami na ayin ndishir ama etum, na kama ngaˈ kop. Ni rir ma si awa atum aba gyo boboˈ agan ama abama, ti awa aba gi kiyami ni wong tuma atu ya ankor yami na nik ba.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ni ritima na nyi ta di, Atikop, ngga ni ri pank wur atu yi pank gin kami wa ni nik ngga.<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />“Asi atikopa adi wu, mhuu, gan didik. Tunde wani nam zup iki tsap, ngga ti dung wa gir etum ntuntun wur.<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />“Gan ni waa na nyi, na adi, Atikop, ngga ni ri pank tung ming ku pank wur kami wani nik ngga.<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />“Atikop na di awama, wa ti gir ntuntun tung.<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Nung awa na nyi, ta di, Atikop, to pank wur mika. Ngga ni rop ka kpak antur, ti shung ka rer. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ngga ni ti shishi mi, wa si ndishir nung awa mi asini je. Ti wa riar ri shisha awowon, wa sher ba kami bawa ni tip baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Si awa adi wu, wasi mbombom gan. Ngga ti wa amoˈ iki yami wani ban na nu mi. Wani gi ngga si ndishir ni je, ni so ki yi sha, ngga wa ya sher kiyami ba ngga ni tippa sang yi? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />To, wa ni gi ama, ani ni dung ba wa ni ne ankor itar ku ne baˈ, in ngga ti nga ngga bi yik kinung ni wong ituma?<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Asi awa adi abami ku atir abuma, ta gin pank gin kama newu nik gan ni sini pank wur ama. <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nema bana ta nyima tadi, Atikop, ai, asi ni pank wur pa. <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Na ta nyima tadi, ngga ban gina, dug awami asi ni ki, ati gyoˈ adom wu ma. Awami asang nga ni ki, ko tsap yami asima na ya, ba ti taya ne wu. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Abami asi dzen zor amung, abami ba kak ngga, gina bi gir ba nyima aba nwun ba iti mung.”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Na Rir Rushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Mi Yesu na ban ama, asi awa ariti ta koma Rushelima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Mi na atip akoma Betafaji nebi Betani asi iba ku Gbu nkunkun Zaitun, asi atum amun koma ami awa, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />na diba, “Gina bi rir vin ntuna yami si iti min. Gina ti rir, gina ti yik vin jaki awami ba na zen na awong wu baˈ atir irop. Gina bi juk wu. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nung tadi, asi ani dung gina juk wu? Gina bi diwu, Atikop arip wu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Abami na tum ba bana koma, ati yik koneni mi Yesu na ban ba. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Asi ba si ming ku juk ka, asi akikima arip ba, “Asi ani dung gina juk vin jaki ma?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Siba di, “Ai Atikop awa a wop wu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Siba gir wu ta koma ni Yesu, asi ba ji ntuntur yi kung kpa man ashur itu vɨn jaki ma, siba tsoˈ Yesu asaˈ tuma. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Aya si ming ku tsin, asi andishir adibi shur ntuntur mang itu tsira.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Mi na tip anyi Rushelima, ananan abum awami tsira ni ji ti koma gbu yi nkunkun Zaitun, asi amun kop ma na bing nidum siba vung nyer Arik, siba agbar wu ni kor kpankpang atu yi kiki yi nik shishi yami bana yik.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Aba di, “Anu didik kasi ku etum awa mi ati nyi ming ku saˈ Atikop. Song keke kasi shu, nkpyaˈ kasi ku Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Asi ani Farisi anung abi si ming andishir na diwu, “Nitsar, wabi tsing amun kop mi aba kung anu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Na tayima tadi, “Ngga ban gina, ko abama ata kung anu, nkpang ni tu man yati te akwa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na gin atu ayi Rushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Mi na tip angaˈ, ta yik ntun Rushelima, asi awa gin atuma. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Na di, “Basi adi aring gina gi kiyami ati wop tiba song keke. Nema ba gina ti gi yik ka baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Nkpang ka nyi kami adzidzen zor amin bati ti gina vin ankawun, ne komajin ta kam gina agong ta te kum na gina. Bati kam gina agong kowani gar. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bati te mbumbur ne gina, taya tsik andishira amin ammi. Ba nkpang gin yi mme min yami ati dung nga itu ku zuman. Yiyama ti nam atu yami ba gina ni ta nyima Arik na nyi aba ta gina ashur baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na war abi rep kiki Kop Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Asi Yesu na rir kop arik ta vung war abi rep kiki, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />awa adi ba, “Ai, na tse ming Reng Arik tadi, Kop mung kasi kop ku ben. Nema gina ni kam ka ti baku shung rer abi gip.” <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kowuni arik adibi tsar kop arik. Nema abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ, abi tsar Musa, ne aningura andishir bana wop tsir ku nwun wu. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Nema baba na yik tsir ku nwun wu baˈ ti reng ma ni tsoˈ itu man abami na si abuma, baba neya ta nyima ko nkpyeng gin bi kam ba baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Aningur baba na ta Yesu nyima baˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Arika nung ama Yesu na rir kop arik na dibi tsar andishir, taya ban ba reng ku re, asi abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ nebi tsar Musa bing neni aningur andishir bana nyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Asi aba diwu, “Ban kwara tsik asaˈ mi, yami wa nam kiki yaya ma,” asiba di, “Nga na nik wa tsi yi nam kiyama?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu ta nyima tadi, “Ngga ma ti rip gina reng. Gina bi ban ngga, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />gbegbereng ku Yohana ni baftisma kasi ri shu, koka si ku andishir ni?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Asi ba reng anne tadi, “Kwara tidi, ya ri shu ti nyi, ati di, ani dung ba kwara ni tawu nyima sang? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kwara tidi, ya ri ne ndishir, andishir nidum ba tag kwara ni nkpang, ti koni nga na saˈ ayi tadi Yohana asi ni reng ne antinte Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Asi aba diwu, “Ba kwara ni gi ba kami arima baˈ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Asi Yesu adi ba, “Ngga ma, ba ngga ban gina ko asi tsi tama ngga nam kiki yama.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyom abi ta arum inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu asi avung ban andishir ankpyeng, ta di, “Bana ti nung na nam arum inabi ma, si awa nik anung abi wum, asi awa koma ntun nung ta ti gong amung nga. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Nkpang ku sher inabi kani ti, asi awa tum gan ama nung aba koma ne adera abami nata aruma, aba tawu mumun inabi nung ri aruma. Nema amun abi ta aruma bana tsik wu, siba adung wu ayok akukur. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Asi ndishira ya tum gan ama nung, nema bana aya tsik wu masima, siba nik wu shisha si aya dung wu akoma ayok akukur. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Na ya tum gan ni tar, siba aya gyoˈ wu nkpak, siba atok wu agyoˈ abum.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />“Asi ayang nga, atikop ne arum inabi adi, aza'a ngga nam are? Ngga ti tum zu mung awami ngga nyer wu. Iyik mung ati shu ba ayi.<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />“Nema si abi ta aruma ayi wu, siba adi akpa man, uhu. To awami ati gir aruma, dung kwara nwun wu, ti gir aruma. <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Siba tog wu agyoˈ gong arum inabi ma, si aba anwun wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“To, asi ani gina yik ni akikima ati nam ne amun abi ta aruma? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ati nyi ta mmi abi ta arum inabi abama, ti aba nik abi ta anung.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Mi andishira bana wo ama siba di, “Arik ba tsoˈ a ngura.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Nema Yesu na to ba tadi, “Asi ani reng Arik kama kati tsar kwara?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:17">Nkpang yami abi mme na kaˈ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">asi ya adza'a si mkpang didik ba baku mme.<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Awami ta roku itu mkpang ama, ati dar, nebi nkpang ama ti roku itu ku nung, ya ti koˈ wu dung wu aba ati mumung.<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rip atu yi wang Kaisar ankor mmimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ayang nga abi tsar Musa ni abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ bana ti aba vung Yesu, mi bana agi naka ban nkpyeng yama atu man, nema bana ti shishi andishir. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Asi ba wop tsir, siba wang andishir anung aba nam tadi abasi adidik. Siba atum aba rip Yesu mbimban anereng yami ati ban, tiba vung wu, ti aba tsoˈ wu anik etum ni tsi nang aba rop. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Abami na tum ba bana rip Yesu, tadi, “Nitsra, kwara ni yik reng nebi tsar mi ya si zup, kwara ni ya yik wani tsoˈ koni nga ananan, wa ya tsar tsir ku Arik ming zup. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Yasi ananan kwara bi wang Kaisar ankor mmimi, ko o'o?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Nema Yesu na gi ki nam man, asi awa diba, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Tsar gin ngga dinari ma. Giu yi nga ni saˈ nga si ituma?” Asiba ta nyima, asi yi Kaisar.<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Asi awa diba, “To, gina bi nik Kaisar kiyami si yi Kaisar, ti nik Arik kiyami si ya Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ayang nga baba na gi vung wu ni reng iti andishir. Asi aba kung nunu ta ti shishi tanyima kiyami na ban ba.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rip atu yi gur Abi kpyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Asi Sadukiyawa anung, abami badi ai ba gur abi kpyi, bana nyi ni Yesu, ta rip, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Nitsar, Musa na tse kwara kiki yama tadi, mi zumin ata kuu ta dung uwama basi ne amumun baˈ ya wyer ra zuman aba ta wu tiba nyir wu amumun. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />To, na ati andishir anung atangba, kap basi amun wa ne kpa. Nkpyaˈ amana na ta uwama ta kuu sang nga vɨvɨn. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ni waa ma nata uwama, ta kuu sang nga vɨvɨn. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Mi ni tar ra na ta uwama. Boboˈ gbaˈ tangba man, na ta uwama, ta kpyi sang amumun. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Itong tera, awa uwama na kuu. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Adzaˈa, gur yebi kpyi, uwama ati si awu nga? Toba, gbaˈ tangba mana bana tawu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu na diba, “Andishir abi mkpang kama anirum ba ta amba ta nik nnga. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Nema abami bati gur ni abi kpyi mkpang ku nyi baba ti nnga baˈ, ko aba ya ta amba baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Biyi ti aba ya kuu baˈ, ba kam ati mi abi tum Arik. Ba ti si amumun Arik atu yami bana gur yebi kpyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Musa na tsar abum tadi abami na kpyi bati gur. Reng ku tuk kami ni reng atu yi Atikop tidi, asi Arik awu Ibrahim. Arik awu Ishaku, nebi Arik awu Yakub. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Awa basi Arik abi kpyi baˈ, nema awu abi si tsitsir. Yama ni tsar tidi newu koneni ya vɨr.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Asi anung abi tsar Musa siba ban reng tadi, “Nitsar wa ni ban ananan.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ayang nga, baba na yasi ni susun mi bati rip wu kinung baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rip atu yi Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu na rip ba tadi, Asi ani dung gina di Kristi asi zu Dawuda? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dawuda ni tuma na tse mgbangwu ku Zabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“ ‘Atikop na di, Atikop.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">“Jisong koˈ ri mung,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />ngga ti dung dzen zor wa awok adza mi.” ’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dawuda nadi wu Atikop. Ti asi ni dung ba adi wu asi zu Dawuda?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na nngan abi tsar Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Mi Yesu na ban amun kop ma iti andishir tadi, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Gina bi to atumin ne abi tsar Musa, abi nyer sung ntuntur rire tiba retan, ta nyer aba tik ba idup, ba nyer aba nik ba abum ni song didik kop ku bing, nebi bubum yi wyer baku gang. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Asi ba sibi ri kiki yi akop amba abami aruruman na kpyi, aba ya ben Arik agong nga, ti aba to ba. Ati, rop ba rop mbombom.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Nik yi uwa nikur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu na gi itu ato, anung aba nkor mi ba agyoˈ ki man baku gyoˈ kop Arik. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Asi ngga yik uwa nikur nung mi na gyoˈ ankor yami ba yana mar kirbi waa baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Asi Yesu adi ba, “Zup ngga ban gina,” Kirbi kami uwa ni sang nga ki na gyoˈ, yani nang yi mbira boboˈ. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Nema boboˈ man bana nik ming ku purik man, tasi awa na nik ming ku sang nga ki man, na gyoˈ boboˈ amun na ankor ayi song ma.<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ban atu ayi jur Kopa Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Anung bana reng atu yi Kop Arik, mi na dong ka ni nkpang yi wyer, nebi kiki mbinban yi nik Arik. Asi Yesu adi, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Atu ayi kiki yiyama mi gina toya, nkpang ka nyi kami ba nkpang nung yami ba dung nga itu ku zuman, koni tama bati jura sher.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuntsa yi ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Asi ba rip wu tadi, “Nitsar, netama kiyama ti nam? Asi kam mbir ati yik nkpang nga mi kikiyama ti nam?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Asi adi ba, gina bi to, kɨr nung aba rem gina. Ti andishir nidum bati nyi ni saˈ mung, tadi, aba si ngga, baya di nkpang kani tip nyi. Kɨr zip ba gin. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Kɨr ti gin shishi mi gina ti wo reng ku kum, nebi gur susun. Yasi ananan kiki yama ti riti ti nyi, nema tong tera bani zen nyi baˈ aring. <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Adibi ban tadi, “Andishir bati kaˈ akpaman, etum ati kaˈ etum. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Ati ti mbombom gyang mmimi, nebi gyong nebi kiki mbombom bubum. Ati yik kinung yi nik shishi yami bana zena ayika baˈ ya far ru ri shu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Tasi mi kiki yama ti nam, bati vung gina, tiba dung ba tun gina tsar. Ati gir gina ta koma akop yi bing ta shur gina jaru, taya gir gina ta koma ne atu atum ni aningur atu yi saˈ mung. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Yiyama yati nik gina nkpang ku ban ne tu min. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Nema se gina bi nam gin asusun amin andanda atu reng nne kiyami gina ti ban ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Ngga ti nik gina ankpyeng nebi gi mi ko gin ming ku abi kaˈ gina baba ti gi kam reng sand ko aba tun kiyami gina ni ban baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Vung ri adida min, ne amun zu min, ne adera min, ne adzidzen amin bati dar gina, bati dung ammi anung ming min. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Koni nga ati kaˈ gina atu yi saˈ mung. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Nema ming min ba awami funfuktu ma gin ti dar. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Tir gbangbang ne tumin, gina ti song.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ban mi Rushelima ti roku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Mi gina ti yik Rushelima abi rop akpa na kama agong, gina bi gi kani tip nyi bi jur. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Abami ba si ming gar Yahudiya, bati tsura rɨr ming gbu. Abami basi tsip bati ru, abami basi vɨn ntun bati rɨr tsip. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ti ngga ban zup nkpang kama kasi ku tun tsar, kati shuma mi na tse. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Anya amba be nne nebi so amumun nkpang kama. Ti mbombom je ti rɨr mmimi ma, nebi nfu Arik kati ji itu ku andishir. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Ati mmi anung ikum, bati ya vuu anung ta koma agan anung nga ati mmi ba. Abami ba basi Yahudawa baˈ bati tun ba tsar Rushelima, se nkpang man kani shuma.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kam nga zu Ndishir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Ati yik kinung yi nik shishi ri ne arik, ni kwa nebi andis. Gong mmimi andishir bati kpura dum ni shishi ta wyir kpa atu yi ndar yi nya. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Andishir bati gbang kuu atu ayi shishi, bati tsur aretan mi bana yik kikiyami ni nam gong mmimi. Ti bati gyang kiki kpyinkpyaˈ yami ya ri gbarshu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Asi ayang nga ati yik Zu Ndishir ata nyi ming akpawur ndo ni tsi ni nkpyaˈ ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Mi kiki yiyama yati vung nam, tir gin adidik ti gi atu min shu, ti tashur min ni tip nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsar atu yi nkunkun bwap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Asi Yesu a ban ba nkpyeng nung, to gin nkunkun bwap ne mbir nkunkun na. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Tsoˈ ri mi kati tup amgbang awuwas, gina ne tumin gina bi gi ikus kani tip nyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Yasi ma, gina ti yik kiki yiyama ya nam, gina bigi gir ya Arik yani tip nyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Ngga ban gina zup, andishir abi nkpang kama baba ti kpyi baˈ se kiki yiyama ni nam. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Gbarshu ni gong mmimi bati dar, nema ankpyeng bati shuk ka baˈ ko tsap. <verse eid="LUK 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Gina bi nanam song. Kɨr nik susun min bi ri kiki ye akwa, ne reng nne song ku gong mmimi bi tsoˈ atu mbor baˈ. In ba ama baˈ, Arika ati nyi ta vung kwara auwa mi agam. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kati nyi itu ku boboˈ awami aku song auwa gong mmimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Gina bi nanam song gin, gina bi ben kop Arik kowani mkpang ti gina bi yik ngbegbereng ku gbangtun kiki yiyama mi yati nam, ti gina biya tir iti ku Zu ndishir.” <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kowuni arik, Yesu atsin atsar Kop Arik, mi arik ta ku na awa aru ta koma Gbu nkunkun Zaitun na awa kur amung nga. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na boboˈ andishir ba nyi na wu nebwebwer tiba wo wu Kop Arik.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Ankpingkpyaˈ na bing atu tiba nwun Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Asi nkpang ku gang yi deng sang nga antu yami agyo ya ti, gang yi zor ya ni tip nyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Asi abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ ni abi tsar Musa bana dibi wop ba nwun Yesu, ti ba ti shishi andishir. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Asi nirem na rir ming susun Yahuza awa mi ba gyo wu ti Iskariyoti, gin ming ku amun kop awur na waa abama. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Asi na yer ta reng ne abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ, nebi abi ber Kopa Arik atu yami aba nik ba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Siba anyer awowon, ta bing atu ayi ankor ayami bati wang wu. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yahuda na tayima ama, asi vung wop tsir kami ati nik ba Yesu, bani gi yi andishir baˈ.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ri gang yi zor ne amun kop ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Arika awu gang yi deng ku Sang nga antu ni kam nyi, arik ni wak vɨn turu Gang yi tok ankpur. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu na tum Bitrus ni Yohana tadi ba, “Gina bi koma ti nam kwara kiri gang yi zor kwara bi ri.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Asiba arip wu tadi, “Wani di aba koma ti nam ani?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Na diba, gina ti rir ming ntun, gina yik ndishir nung agir irin amashir. Gina bi dzip wu kop kami ati rira. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Gina bidi ndishir ni kopa, Nitsar na tum kwara bi di wa, “Tar kami ngga nibi amun kop amung ti ri kiri gang yi Zor?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ati tsar gina tar ku shu nkpyaˈ naka nam ka. Ayang nga gina ti nam koneni. <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Siba koma, tayik koneni ananan mi Yesu na ban ba, siba ya nam kiri Gang yi Zor.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kpa Atikop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Nkpang kani ti, asi Yesu a song abing ne bi tum ama ti aba ri kiri. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Asi adi ba, “Ngga ni ti gyong yi ri Gang yi Zor bing ne gina aring, tiba tun ngga tsar. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ti Ngga ya ban gina, baga tiya ri gang yama baˈ, se ni shuma aba nam ma song Arik.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Si awa tsoˈ antse, ta nyer Arik, tadi, “Gina bi ta ti gab akpamin. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ngga ban gina, ri adzaˈa ba ngga tiya so amashir inabi awama baˈ se song Arik kani nyi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Si awa tsoˈ deng, ta anyer a Arik, ta tsikamwe, ta nik ba, tadi, “Yiyama si kpa mung kami ati nik ka atumin. Gina bi min nam ama ti min shum ngga.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Nema, gong kpama, na tsoˈ antse, tadi, “Antse kama si rop bing wuwas yami na gi asi agi mung awami ati tak wu sher atumin. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Awami ati dar ngga awa ari bing ni ngga. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Zu Ndishir ati kuu mi na ban, nema anya ndishir awami ati nik wu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Asi amun kop ba vung rip akpaman asi nga ming mbor ati nam ama.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Attam na gur nga wa si kpyaˈ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Asi attam agur ming amun kop atu ayi nga wa tisi nkyaˈ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu na diba, atum andishir abi sang nga gi Arik aba tsar andishir aman tsi, nema aningura badi natu man, aba rak andishira. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Nema bi song gina ming min. Itu ku ama, dung nkpyaˈ ming min abasi tsap, nigur abasi mi ni nam ndum. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Nga wa sini muema, asi awami a song bi ri ankyaˈ, ko asi awami nam kiri? I, awami aku song adibi rima. To ngga wa ming min mi ni gir kiri ankyaˈ. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Gina bami ni tir gbangbang ndo ni ngga kiki mbombom yami ngga ni yik. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Yasi ananan mi Ada mung na nik ngga gir ne bi tsi, ti ngga ya nik gina, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Gina bi ri ti so ndo ni ngga iron yi etum, gina bi ya si ni ngga song Arik, gina ti gir akop awur ne waa ayi Israˈila.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus ati tun gi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Bitrus, Bitrus. Wabi wo ayang. Nirem na wop tsir ku itu gina boboˈ, ta reng gina mi nivum areng npyeng ming anfur. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Nema ngga ni ben, Bitrus, kɨr ban zup min bi kornyin. Mi wa ti kam nyi ni ngga, wabi gir amun zu min ngbangbang. <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Bitrus na ta nyima tadi, “Atikop, ngga ku tir ti zipwa koma jaru. Tasi kuu, kwara kuu ndo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu nadi, “Ngga ban wa, Bitrus, tsori agbaˈ aba tok ibuu yi ring, wa tidi bawa ni gi ngga baˈ aza tar.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gina bi nam atumin nkpang ku tuntsar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Asi Yesu arip amun kop tadi, “Nkpang kami ngga ni tum gina sang nga aporo ankor, sang nga kiri, sang nga akpadza, gina ni wop kinung rakana yi?” Siba di “O'o.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Na diba, adza'a wami tasi na aporo ankor, nebi kiri, aba tsoˈ agir, awami basi ne anji gbang baˈ, aba tsoˈ antur ama arep ta rep. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ngga ban gina tin di, kiyami na Tse ya Reng Arik, siba bing wu ming ku abi nam zup mbombom, kiyama shuma. <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Amun kop na diwu, “Atikop, to anji gbang mi waa ya.” Yesu na diba yini mara.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ben tugbu nkunkun Zaitun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu na dung tsip, ta wong Tugbu nkunkun Zaitun mi atsina nam. Amun kop ma siba adzip wu. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Mi na rɨr abuma, asi adi ba, “Gina bi ben pa, ti kɨr gina bi roku ming zup mbombom.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Asi ari iti ta tip adung ba gbangbang, yire nkpang, si awa atar agbarung ta ben. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Na di, “Ada, wati tayima wabi tsoˈ ngga antse ku tuntsar. Basi yik mung baˈ, asi yik mi ati dzip.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Asi ni tum Arik ari shu ta rutir wu ta dibi nik wu reng. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Mi asi ming ku tuntsar awowon, si awa nanam atir gbangbang ming ku ben, achir ya ji wu mi agi ta kpyeng asher mmimi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Yesu na gur baku ben, asi akama koma na amun kop ibama, na yik ba ku akur nna basi ming ku reng anne. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Na diba, “Asi ani dung gina kur nna? Gur gin, gina bi ben dung kɨr gina bi roku ming zup mbombom.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na vung Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Bana zen akung anu baˈ, asi bing ya andishir ba nyi. Gin ming ku awur na waa abama ni saˈ Yahuza na gir ba ta nyi. Asi atip anyi ni Yesu tiba nyinu gir. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Nema Yesu adi wu, “Yahuza, asima, ni nyin wati nik Zu Ndishir?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Amun kop abami basi ndo ni Yesu bana yik ama, siba ripwu, siba di, “Atikop, kwara bi nam ndum na jigbang yi?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Asi gin ming man na chem gan nkpyaˈ awu ni tok ankpur, ta kyaˈ tong ma ku koˈ iri. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Yesu na diba, “Gina bi dung.” Asi awa tuu tong ku ndishir awami na chem wu ma, asi awa wyer. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesu na di aningur abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ ni abi ber Kop Arik ni aningur andishir, abami bana nyi ti aba vung wu, “Gina ni ru ni jijigbang, ni akpuki gina ni nyi bi vung ngga mi ni kpyaˈ tsir yi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Kowuni arik ngga si ndo ne gina Kop Arik, ba gina ni vung gin ngga baˈ. Nema yiyama asi nkpang min ku tsi yi buu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus na tun gi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Asi ba vung Yesu ta gir wu ta koma, siba gir wu ta rir kop ningur ni tok ankpur. Bitrus na dibi zip ba gbangbang. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Mi bana mok wur ras ku kop pa siba jisong, Bitrus masi na jisong neba. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Gin ming ku agan amun amba abami ba nam ndum kopa mi na yik wu aku song tong wur, siba sung wu ayi asi di, “Ndi, ndishira awama basi ndo nebi Yesu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Nema si Bitrus na tun tadi, “Kat. Ba ngga ni gi wu baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Gong ku vin nkpang tsap, ndishir nung na to Bitrus, tadi, “Adi, wa si gin ming mana.” Nema Bitrus na kaˈ tadi, “Kat. Basi ngga baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Bi yini gong baˈ asi ndishir nung aya di, “Zup ndishir awama asi ndo newu, asi ndishir ni Galili masi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Nema Bitrus nadi, “Anyia. Ba ngga ni gi kiyami wa ban baˈ.” Mi bana zen na kung anu baˈ asi agbaˈ atok. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Atikop na kam ato Bitrus. Asi Bitrus ashum reng mi Atikop na ban wu, “Kamin agbaˈ aba tok ibuu yi ring nga wa tidi, ba wani gi ngga baˈ adza tar.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Asi awa aru abum ta kubi gin kpankpang.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na gyap Yesu, taya tsik wu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Asi abami sibi ber Yesu ma siba vung agyap wu taya tsik wu. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Asi arop wu ayi, taya arip wu, “Tiba ban, nga na tsik wa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Asi aba dibi ban wu ane reng ni mmar.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na gir Yesu ta koma iti aningur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Mi ambwer na nngan, si aningura andishir ne abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ ne abi tsar Musa bana bing, siba gir Yesu ta koma iti aningur. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Asi badi, “Ban kwara, asi wa si Kristi yi?” Asi wa ta nyima tadi, “Ngga ti ban gina ba gina ti di asi zup baˈ, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ngga ti ya rip gina ba gina ti tanyima baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Nema tsoˈ ri adza'a Zu ndishir ati song koˈ iri ku Arik ni Tsi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Asi boboˈ mana ba di, “Wa, awama wasi Zu Arik yi?” Awa tayima tadi, “Gina ban, asi ngga.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Asi ba di, “Tiya si ani kwara ya wop aba ya ban? I, kwara natu mbor ni wo kiyami na ban anuma.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Na gir Yesu ta koma iti Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Asi amun kop etum na bing boboˈ ta gir Yesu ta koma iti Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Asi aba bwar wu tadi, “Kwara ni yik awama adibi kpura andishir mbor, adi ba, kɨr aba wang Kaisar ankor mmimi baˈ. Adibi di, awa si Kristi etum.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Asi Bilatus a rip wu tadi, “Wa si etum ani Yahuda yi?” Yesu adi, “Wani ban asima.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Asi Bilatus adi abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ ne andishir, “Ba ngga ni yik, ndishira ma na chok kinung ara baˈ.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Asi ba rima dibi tir ngbanggbang tadi, “Ni tsar ma yani chok asusun andishir ra boboˈ igar Yahudiya. Na tsoˈ ari Galili, adza'a awa iba kama.” <verse eid="LUK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Mi Bilatus na wo ama, si awa arip, ta di, “Asi ndishir ni Galili yi?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Mi na wo adi Yesu ari gar kami Hiridus asi etum ma, si wa adi aba gir Yesu ta koma ni Hiridus, nkpang ku ma Hiridus asi Rushelima. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Hiridus na nyer awowon mi na yik Yesu, tsori mi awa na dibi ti ba yik wu, naka amin wo ane reng ama ta dibi nne susun ayi aba yik kinung nik shishi yami Yesu ati ka nam. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Asi Hiridus na rip wu nidum, nema Yesu bana na diwu kinung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Asi abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ ne abi tsar Musa bana na tir mgbamgban ta ban anareng ambombom itu ku Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Asi Hiridus nebi rop akpa na mmar nawu, siba gyap wu, ta sung wu antur ankpyaˈ, siba gir wu ta kam akoma nibi Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Asi arika ma ani Hiridus nebi Bilatus bana vung dzidzen ne akpa man, atu yami ba bana min ata akpa man anyima baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatus na bing abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ, nebi ningur atum nebi andishir boboˈ, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />si adi ba, “Gina ni gir gin ngga ndishira, adi adibi chok andishir. Adza'a ngga ni rip wu iti min, ba ngga ni yik wu na tara mi na gir wu nyima itimung baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Nema Hiridus, siya dung na gir wu akama nga ayang na kwara. Ba kinung yami ndishira ma na nam yami ni mmar aba nwun wu. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Yati sima ati tsik wu ta gyoˈ wu aba koma kima.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />I kowuni gang yi Zor asi Bilatus aya gyoˈ ndishir gin awami na kung wu, awami andishir bata ben. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Nema siba ti akwa zagin ta di, “Aba gir wu ta riti, aba gyoˈ kwara Barnabas.” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Awami na kung wu jaru atu ayami na chok asusun ara ntun na, ti dung bana nwun ndishir. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Asi Bilatus aya kama reng naba, ta ti aba gyoˈ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Asi ba dibi ti akwa, siba adi, “Aba mkpang ta kor wu. Aba mkpang ta kor wu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Bilatus na nanam adi ba adza tar, “Atu yi ani? Asi zup mbombom tama ndishira ma na nam? Ba ngga ni yik wu na chok kinung ara yami ni mar aba nwun wu baˈ. Ngga dung atsik wu, ta gyoˈ wu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Asiba kak ta tir gbangbang, tadi seba mkpang ta kor wu. I tong tera bana ri kong. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Bilatus ato si awak amoˈ ayami bana ta nyima. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Asi agyoˈ Barnabas awami adi aba gyoˈ, awami na girwu ta arir jaru atu yami na chok asusun ara ta nwun nung. Asi Bilatus anik ba Yesu towa, gina bi nam wu ki yami gina ni yik.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na mkpang ta kor Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Mi abi rop akpa bana gir Yesu, ta si ming ku tsin, siba mara kpa nibi nung agyo wu ti Siman, ndishir ni Sayirin, atsin na ri vin ntun. Siba vung wu, ta tsoˈ angau asaˈ wu aba sur ta dzip Yesu gong. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Andishir nidum awowon bana dibi dzip wu, ming mana ti vung amba abami agin, siba chira atong atu ma. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Nema Yesu na kama to ta diba, amba bi Rushelima, kɨr gina bi gin atumung, gina bi gin atumin nibi amumun na min. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Nkpang ka nyi kami andishir ba di, asi kiyi nyer nebi amba abami bana dzen na anyira to baˈ, abami baba nyir baˈ, awa mi bana dzen amang ake ama baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Bata di gbu, “Wabi roku itu mbor.” Bati yadi akumgbu, “Aba ba kung kwara.” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Tasi mi ati nam kiyama nkunkun nyinyin, kati si are in kasi nkunkun kukur? <verse eid="LUK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Na ya gir andishir anung a waa abami na tara ti aba nwun ba ndo nibi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Mi bana rir abum awami agyo wu ti, “Akpawe itu,” siba mkpang ta kor wu abumma, ndo nibi andishir abi tara bama, gin ikoˈ rima, gin ikoˈ mwarma.<verse eid="LUK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na mkpang ta kor Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Asi Yesu adi ba, “Ada, wabi tsoˈ ba zup mbombom man agura, ti ba bana gi kiyami ba nam baˈ.” Siba agab akpa man ntuntur ma iba ku tun yi tsoˈ. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Andishir ba ku atir bi to. Aningur aman bana dibi bwar wu, siba di, “Na ta anung ashur, to, aba ta tuma gyoˈ, tiba to. Wati si Kristi awu Arik, ni tun ama.” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Abi rop akpa ma siba bwar wu, ta koma siba nap wu mwamwang amashir inabi. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Siba ya di, “Wati si Etum ani Yahuda, ta tumi gyoˈ tin to.” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Shuma na wu, na tse tadi, “AWAMA ASI AWA SI ETUM ANI YAHUDA.” <verse eid="LUK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Gin ming ku abi nam zup mbombom abami na mkpang ta kor ba bing, areng wu mmar, si adi, “Ndi, asiwa sini si Kristi yi? Ta itumi gyoˈ, tika ya ta kwara shur noo!.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Nema gin na tsing awuwu ma ta di, “Ba wa ti shishi Arik sang yi? Wa, mi na rop wa ananan na wu? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Kwara ba, na nam kwara ananan, ti kwara ni ta rop mbor atu yi kiyami kwara ni nam. Tasi awa, na nam zup mbombom tama?” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Naya di, “Wa Yesu, wabi shum ngga etum mi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu na diwu, “Zup ngga ban wa, aring awa ma wati song ndo ni ngga gbarshu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mi Yesu na kuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Abuma na tsutsu arik, ibuu ni kung boboˈ gar ntuna, gira ma ti koma tar ku arika gur. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Arik na dung der. Dinden kami si ming Kop Arik si ka nngar shur waa. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Asi Yesu agi kor gbangbang tadi, “Ada. Ming ayok ami ngga nik rim mung.” Na ban ama, asi agbur vɨrma ku tong ter siwa kuu. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ni rop akpa nkpyaˈ ni Roma awa mi basi bama na yik kiyami ni nam, asi wa agbar saˈ Arik ta adi, “Zup, ndishir awama asi awu Arik.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Mi andishir abami na bing ti aba to na yik kiyami ni nam, si kap man na akam ma koma kop ta dibi atsik asang aman. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Nema andishir abami na gi Yesu, nebi amba abami na dzip wu tsoˈ ri gar Galili, ba na tir shan ta dibi to.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mi na ru Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Na ti ndishir nung ni saˈ Yusuf, asi gin ming ku aningur asi ndishir didik, Awani Yahuda, aya si ni nam ki didik, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />awami bana ta nyima ni kiyami bana rop abing aba anam baˈ ari ntun nung yi Yahuda ming gar Arimatiya. Awa anyer etum ku Arik ka bi nyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Asi akoma ni Bilatus tiba ben aba nik wu kum Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Asi agir kum ma aji ma, ta rop ka ni kpaˈ antur lilin, ta gyoˈ ka gun nung kami na shep ka nkpang, yami bana dzen na gyoˈ nung ming baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Arik ni nanam nam, ti nvi yi song shi ni tip nyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Amba abami na dzip Yesu ari Galili siba koma ndo neni Yusuf ti aba ti to mi guna ka sima tiba ya tanyima aba gyoˈ kum Yesu ma. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Nema si ba kam akoma kop, siba bing anyi shishim ni nuk kpa. Arik ni song shi yi Yahudawa, siba song ashi mi bang yi Musa ni ban.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Gur Yesu nebi kpyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Na bwebwer nvɨ yi vung ndum yi gin, amba ma bana koma guna ni kiki yi si shishim yami bana nam ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Siba rima yik na nyin nkpang agura anu guna. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Siba arir ming nga, ankyaˈ ba bana yik kpa ku Atikop Yesu baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Tsori mi basi ming ku to kiyami ni nam, siba yik andishir anung awaa aku tir anga ba, ba ku tir ne ntuntur kikar yami ya der awowon. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Bana shuma ni shishi, asi amba ma aji atu man ashur mmimi. Andishira ba arip, “Ani dung gina wop awami si tsitsir ming abi kpyi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ba sima baˈ, na gur. Gina bi shum kiyami na ban gina tsoˈ ri mi asi Galili. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Na di, asima aba nik Zu Ndishir ayok andishira bi nam zup mbombom, aba kor wu, nvi yi tar tiba gur.” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Asi amba ma ashum reng ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Mi bana kam ma nga ari guna, siba ban amun kop ma awur na gin neni mbira andishir boboˈ ya kiki yama. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Amba ma siba ban abi tum Arik iya kikiyama, asi ni Maryamu Magadaliya, ne Yuwana, ne Maryamu iyama Yakubu, ne amba anung mi basi ndo ne ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Nema andishir bana tsoˈ reng ku amba ma asi kiyi sha ankyaˈ, asi ba kaˈ ta nyima. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Asi Bitrus na gura tir wuf. Ta koma gun na ne tsur. Na jido, ta doto ming nga, na yik lilin bana jika ne tong gin. Asi akama koma kop ta dibi shum kiyami ni nam.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na far aru amun kop ma awaa tsir Imawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Nvi yama, amun kop Yesu awaa, ba tsin akoma vɨn ntun nung yami saˈ ma si Imawus. Yami yare ri Rushelima yasi ankpang atangba. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Siba dibi tsin bi reng ne kpaman boboˈ kiki yami yini nam. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Basi ming ku reng, siba bur kiki nung aruma, asi Yesu ni ituma atip akoma neba siba bing tsin ndo newu. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Nema ayiman na kung, baba na to wu agi baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Asi Yesu adi ba, “Gina reng ani ne kpa min, mi gina si ming ku tsin?” Siba gbutir chip, na rop atiman. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Gin ming mana, saˈ ma si Kiliyobas, siwa ta nyima tadi, “Asi wa ne mkpami si tsin Rushelima, ti bawa ni gi kiyami ya tsin nvi yama sang yi?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Asi wa diba, “Kiki tama?” Ba na ta nyima, “Kiki yami na nam Yesu ni Nazaret.” Awami asi ni reng ne antinte Arik ne tsi ming ndum ma ne reng iti Arik ne boboˈ andishir, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Abi tok ankpur ankpyingkpyaˈ ne aningur ambor bana dung na rop wu yi kuu, siba kor wu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Mi kwara ni nne susun ti di asiwa ti ta Israˈila gyoˈ. To wa, aring nvi yi tar tsoˈ ri mi kiyama ni nam. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Gong kama amba nung ming mbor na nik kwara shishi. Ba na koma guna ne bwebwer, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />nema ba bana yik kpa ma baˈ. Siba akam, siba di na tiba rimrar, siba yik abi tum Arik abami badi asi tsitsir. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Anung ming mbor bana koma guna siba yik kima ananan mi amba na ban, nema tasi awa, ba kwara ni yik wu baˈ. <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Asi Yesu adi ba, “Asi ani, gina abi sang nga susun, ba gina nama ta nyima ni kiyami abi reng ne antinte Arik bana ban. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Yasi ananan Kristi aba tun wu atsar kikiyama, ti baya rir nkpyaˈ ma?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Si awa avung juk shur ba boboˈ kiyami na tseya Reng Arik ta ban ituma, rini tsar Musa ti koma agbangwu abi reng ne antinte Arik boboˈ. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Mi ni dik tsap aba rir vin ntun yami ba koma, asi Yesu anam desi ati gari, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />nema siba gir wu tadi, jisong ne kwara, I, arikagur na ti, to arik boboˈ na roku. Si awa adzip ba ajisong abumma. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Mi bana jisong ba ti ri kiri, siwa tsoˈ deng ta nyer Arik, ta mwue ka asi nik ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ayang na yang si ayi man abu, siba ya gi wu. Nema si wa nang adar ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Siba adi akpa man, “Ashe, asusun mbor baka ni chokra nkpang kami adibi reng ne kwara tsir, ta dibi ban kwara tse Reng Arik?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Siba agur ta nam ma andanda ta kam akoma Rushelima. Siba ayik amun kop ma awur ne gin ndo ne andishir anung, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />siba di, “I, Atikop na gur didika, na rutir ne Bitrus.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Sima kpak waa man, siba vung ban anereng atu yi Yesu kiyami na nam tsir, nebi yami bana yik nkpang kami adibi mwe deng.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndum kami Yesu na nik amun kop ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Basi ming ku reng atu yama, ankyaˈ si Yesu awa asi ndo taku tir adidik atsutsu man, asi diba, “Keke kasi ne gina.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Shishi ni tiba siba wyir akpa, badi asi ndishir ni kuu ru bana yik. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Siwa diba, “Asi ani gina ti shishi ama, tiya kak tanyima asusun amin? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Gina bito ayoˈ amung ne adza mung ti yik, asi ngga ni tu mung. Gina bi saˈ ngga koˈ, ti wo, ndishir ni kuu ru basi ni nam nebi kuku baˈ, mi gina ni yik ngga sima neba.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Mi na ban ama, si awa tsar ba ayok ama ne adzama. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Nema ba bana ta nyima baˈ, tiba sini mbir shishi nebi nyer awowon kiyama, siwa di ba, “Gina sine kiri ayang nga yi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Siba anik wu ndang ambe ku uwuk, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />na ta tang, iti man.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Siwa di ba, “Yi yama si kiki yami ngga ni ban reng atuma tsoˈ ri mi ngga nisi ndo ne gina, yasi ananan koneni bi shuma mi na tse atu mung ming amoˈ yi Musa, ne agbangwu abi reng ne antinte Arik, nebi Zabura.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Si awa abu asusun aman siba agi kiyami na tse Reng Arik, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />na ya adi ba, “Ya sima na tse tadi asi ananan Kristi aba tun wu atsar, nvi yi tar aba ya gur ari nebi kpyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Ti andishir ba kam asan boboˈ gong mmimi ta ban ba reng ku re tiba tsoˈ zup mbombom man agura atu yi saˈ mung. Ati tsoˈ ari ni Rushelima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Gina si abi yik ti ban kiki yama. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />To gin, ngga ti tum gina ni kiyami Ada mung na nik anu atuma. Nema na di gina bi ngup ntuna aring, se bana nik gina tsi ari shu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na tsoˈ Yesu ta koma shu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Asi awa gir ba aruma ntuna, siba rir Betani. Abuma si awa agi koˈ ma si awa nik ba anu didik. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Na si ming ku nik ba anu didik ayang nga, asi wa adung ba, asi atsoˈ wu ta koma shu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Siba gbaru, siba kam akoma Rushelima ni nyer awowon. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Nebi kowuni nkpang basi ming Kop Arik ta dibi gbar saˈ Arik.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>